<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:09.170" end="00:00:11.800" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.440" end="00:00:13.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly, Jiao, you&#39;re the person I</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.800" end="00:00:15.400" style="s2">admire most in our class.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.240" end="00:00:17.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, without Jiao, we&#39;d never get to</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.400" end="00:00:19.880" style="s2">enjoy a luxury cruise like this.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.400" end="00:00:22.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s no big deal. This is pocket change</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.880" end="00:00:24.960" style="s2">for me. I just want everyone to have A</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.120" end="00:00:24.960" style="s2">GOOD TIME.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.160" end="00:00:41.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE am I?</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.920" end="00:00:53.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My phone&#39;s gone. We can&#39;t contact</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.160" end="00:00:55.080" style="s2">anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.680" end="00:00:56.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My phone got soaked, too.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.080" end="00:00:59.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do?</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.360" end="00:00:59.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we going to be trapped here forever?</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.240" end="00:01:05.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, stay calm. We just have to</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.320" end="00:01:05.960" style="s2">hold out for 2 days. The rescue team</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.239" end="00:01:07.440" style="s2">will come.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.960" end="00:01:08.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We won&#39;t have to wait 2 days. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.440" end="00:01:10.840" style="s2">already messaged my rescue team. They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.960" end="00:01:13.040" style="s2">professionals. They&#39;ll find us tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.840" end="00:01:15.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something&#39;s wrong. ANYA ISN&#39;T LOOKING</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.040" end="00:01:15.480" style="s2">WELL.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.720" end="00:01:24.080" style="s2">IS HE CHOKING? HE&#39;S BARELY BREATHING.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.600" end="00:01:26.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do? Can anyone help? We have</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.080" end="00:01:28.720" style="s2">to do something, or he&#39;ll be in serious</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.200" end="00:01:28.720" style="s2">trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.560" end="00:01:33.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, move. I know first aid.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.216" end="00:01:42.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.880" end="00:01:48.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Linyou, you shameless creep. You took</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.640" end="00:01:51.880" style="s2">advantage of me and groped me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.840" end="00:01:52.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I groped you? Anya, look careful. I just</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.880" end="00:01:54.920" style="s2">saved your life.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.960" end="00:01:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re lying. Did saving me really</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.920" end="00:01:59.240" style="s2">require mouth-to-mouth and touching my</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.880" end="00:02:00.932" style="s2">chest? You were clearly taking advantage</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.240" end="00:02:03.012" style="s2">of me while I was unconscious.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.932" end="00:02:04.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lian Yu, I can&#39;t believe it. I never</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.012" end="00:02:05.452" style="s2">thought you&#39;d be the kind of guy to take</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.132" end="00:02:06.412" style="s2">advantage of a beauty like Anne while</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.452" end="00:02:08.052" style="s2">she was unconscious.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.412" end="00:02:10.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve shown your true colors the second</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.052" end="00:02:12.332" style="s2">we got to the island. You&#39;re disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.172" end="00:02:13.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lian Yu, we just survived a shipwreck</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.332" end="00:02:14.332" style="s2">and you pull a disgusting stunt like</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.772" end="00:02:17.612" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.332" end="00:02:19.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I TOLD YOU I DIDN&#39;T. I WAS SAVING HER.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.612" end="00:02:21.532" style="s2">YOU ALL SAW IT WITH YOUR OWN EYES.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.572" end="00:02:22.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU JUST WANTED TO GET YOUR HANDS on</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.532" end="00:02:23.652" style="s2">Anne, yeah?</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.372" end="00:02:24.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a good look at yourself BEFORE YOU</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.652" end="00:02:26.612" style="s2">START JUDGING OTHERS.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.772" end="00:02:27.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now the cruise ship is gone. We still</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.612" end="00:02:29.572" style="s2">don&#39;t know what we&#39;re dealing with on</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.772" end="00:02:31.612" style="s2">this island, but we need teammates with</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.572" end="00:02:33.452" style="s2">some decency, not a lowlife who takes</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.612" end="00:02:35.212" style="s2">advantage of someone in need. So I say</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.452" end="00:02:37.372" style="s2">we kick Lian Yu out right now. Having</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.212" end="00:02:38.612" style="s2">someone this despicable around will only</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.372" end="00:02:39.492" style="s2">put us all in danger.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.612" end="00:02:40.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.492" end="00:02:42.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get rid of him. I don&#39;t want to be</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.932" end="00:02:44.692" style="s2">around a creep like that.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.172" end="00:02:47.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a pervert. Get out of here. Leave</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.692" end="00:02:47.732" style="s2">this beach now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.692" end="00:03:00.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding. The host saved someone in public,</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.052" end="00:03:02.852" style="s2">was falsely accused, and kicked out by</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.852" end="00:03:05.652" style="s2">the whole group. Desert Island Fishing</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.852" end="00:03:07.732" style="s2">System activated. Congratulations, host.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.652" end="00:03:08.932" style="s2">You&#39;ve received a starter pack. Open it</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.732" end="00:03:12.892" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.932" end="00:03:12.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Desert Island Fishing System.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.972" end="00:03:16.892" style="s2">Open it now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.892" end="00:03:17.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding. Starter pack opened successfully.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.892" end="00:03:18.972" style="s2">Congratulations, host. You received a</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.972" end="00:03:20.172" style="s2">basic fishing rod, beginner fishing</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.972" end="00:03:20.532" style="s2">mastery, and max level island survival</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.172" end="00:03:21.812" style="s2">skills.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.532" end="00:03:23.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fully mastered.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.812" end="00:03:24.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The host can catch any fish. Unlocking a</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.292" end="00:03:25.692" style="s2">new fish for the first time earns a fish</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.532" end="00:03:27.212" style="s2">guide reward with a small chance of</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.692" end="00:03:29.012" style="s2">getting fresh water, food, tools,</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.212" end="00:03:31.332" style="s2">building materials, medicine, and other</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.012" end="00:03:33.052" style="s2">survival supplies.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.332" end="00:03:35.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really works.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.052" end="00:03:37.732" style="s2">With this system, I&#39;ll own this island.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.572" end="00:03:39.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kicked me out after I saved you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.732" end="00:03:41.412" style="s2">Tomorrow, you&#39;ll be begging to get on my</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.732" end="00:03:44.212" style="s2">good side.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.412" end="00:03:45.332" style="s2">I&#39;m so thirsty. Joe, do you have any</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.212" end="00:03:47.612" style="s2">water?</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.332" end="00:03:49.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m thirsty, TOO, DAMN IT. EVERYONE STAY</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.612" end="00:03:51.172" style="s2">CALM. I&#39;ve watched tons of survival</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.332" end="00:03:53.052" style="s2">documentaries. I almost worked with Bear</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.172" end="00:03:54.572" style="s2">Grylls, you know? So I&#39;d say I&#39;m pretty</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.052" end="00:03:55.612" style="s2">good at surviving in the wild.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.572" end="00:03:57.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s great.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.612" end="00:03:58.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huo Jia, since you&#39;ve got experience,</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.252" end="00:04:00.492" style="s2">you can lead us from here on. We&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.932" end="00:04:02.052" style="s2">as you say and stick together until the</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.492" end="00:04:03.494" style="s2">rescue team gets here.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.052" end="00:04:04.934" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it&#39;s all on you to call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.494" end="00:04:05.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My rescue team should be here any</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.934" end="00:04:07.654" style="s2">minute.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.694" end="00:04:09.534" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BUT I&#39;M DYING OF THIRST.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.654" end="00:04:12.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEAVE it to me, Jiao. I&#39;ll make sure</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.534" end="00:04:14.334" style="s2">you&#39;re the first to get a drink.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.014" end="00:04:16.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, split into groups. Anyone who</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.334" end="00:04:18.254" style="s2">can&#39;t swim stays on the beach. The rest</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.414" end="00:04:19.934" style="s2">of you, come with me and search the</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.254" end="00:04:21.574" style="s2">wreckage offshore. If we can salvage</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.934" end="00:04:23.814" style="s2">some food and water, we&#39;ll make it</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.574" end="00:04:26.054" style="s2">through the night.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.814" end="00:04:28.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I found something.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.054" end="00:04:31.934" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I found it. It&#39;s a WHOLE CASE OF</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.134" end="00:04:31.934" style="s2">VACUUM-SEALED BOTTLED WATER.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.974" end="00:04:46.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARE YOU kidding me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.934" end="00:04:46.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Look at that fish.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.374" end="00:05:07.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding. Congratulations, host. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.694" end="00:05:09.414" style="s2">caught a giant grouper. Ding. Giant</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.134" end="00:05:11.254" style="s2">grouper added to your fish index. Ding.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.414" end="00:05:13.334" style="s2">Congratulations, host. You&#39;ve earned the</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.254" end="00:05:14.654" style="s2">giant grouper&#39;s fish index reward, a</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.334" end="00:05:15.374" style="s2">permanent boost to your physical</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.654" end="00:05:16.734" style="s2">abilities.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.374" end="00:05:18.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is what a soldier&#39;s strength</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.734" end="00:05:22.094" style="s2">feels like. I feel like I could take Liu</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.574" end="00:05:22.094" style="s2">Weiwei out with one punch.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.134" end="00:05:25.174" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t expect to get a bonus out of</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.334" end="00:05:27.134" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.174" end="00:05:28.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiao, you&#39;re such a blowhard. Who knows</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.134" end="00:05:30.414" style="s2">if that rescue team of his is even real?</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.974" end="00:05:32.494" style="s2">But with this case of water and the</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.414" end="00:05:34.894" style="s2">grouper, I&#39;ve got food and water covered</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.494" end="00:05:34.894" style="s2">for now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.174" end="00:05:42.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, hand over the FISH AND WATER. NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.494" end="00:05:42.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I WORKED HARD TO HAUL ALL THIS OUT OF</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.014" end="00:05:44.374" style="s2">THE SEA.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.574" end="00:05:46.734" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EXACTLY. We salvaged that water</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.374" end="00:05:49.254" style="s2">together. It belongs to the whole class.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.734" end="00:05:50.694" style="s2">And we spotted that big fish first, too.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.254" end="00:05:52.494" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to keep it all for</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.694" end="00:05:54.174" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.494" end="00:05:56.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I caught the fish.</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.174" end="00:05:58.214" style="s2">You had nothing to do with it. As for</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.054" end="00:05:59.894" style="s2">the stuff you salvaged, it&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.214" end="00:06:01.934" style="s2">That&#39;s just your bad luck.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.894" end="00:06:04.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does that have to do with me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.934" end="00:06:04.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, stop trying to talk your way out of</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.134" end="00:06:05.895" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.574" end="00:06:07.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That fishing rod in your hands is</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.895" end="00:06:09.095" style="s2">clearly from the cruise ship.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.295" end="00:06:10.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I paid to charter the entire ship.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.095" end="00:06:11.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, everything on it, including that</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.335" end="00:06:13.895" style="s2">rod, belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.775" end="00:06:14.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my rod. I brought it myself. It</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.895" end="00:06:16.695" style="s2">didn&#39;t come from the ship.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.975" end="00:06:18.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yours. A broke loser like you could</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.695" end="00:06:19.615" style="s2">afford a rod like that. Leo, hand it</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.495" end="00:06:20.215" style="s2">over if you know what&#39;s good for you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.615" end="00:06:23.015" style="s2">Don&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.215" end="00:06:27.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Teach you a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.015" end="00:06:27.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, how could you hit a classmate?</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.375" end="00:06:36.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which one of you saw me hit Zhao Yu?</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.815" end="00:06:37.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He put the handcuffs on himself.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.295" end="00:06:39.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.415" end="00:06:40.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE&#39;S ALONE. WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.615" end="00:06:43.055" style="s2">TAKE HIM OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.975" end="00:06:44.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEO, YOU&#39;RE NOT LEAVING WITHOUT HANDING</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.055" end="00:06:46.159" style="s2">OVER THE STUFF.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.139" end="00:06:46.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.295" end="00:06:51.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.015" end="00:06:57.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IF YOU&#39;RE GOING TO AMBUSH SOMEONE, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.055" end="00:06:59.975" style="s2">yell first.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.415" end="00:06:59.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.135" end="00:07:11.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s lit. It&#39;s lit.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.935" end="00:07:13.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gross.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.895" end="00:07:14.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never seen a fire before? What&#39;s all the</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.735" end="00:07:17.215" style="s2">yelling for?</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.615" end="00:07:18.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao, Leo&#39;s way too full of himself. He</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.215" end="00:07:20.375" style="s2">stole our stuff and thinks he can throw</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.935" end="00:07:21.895" style="s2">his weight around on this island.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.375" end="00:07:23.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, Zhao. When your rescue team</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.895" end="00:07:24.855" style="s2">gets here, make him pay.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.255" end="00:07:26.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHOW LEO WHO&#39;S REALLY IN CHARGE.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.855" end="00:07:29.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T WORRY. I won&#39;t forget this</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.775" end="00:07:32.095" style="s2">beating. Just wait till the rescue team</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.135" end="00:07:34.215" style="s2">gets here. I&#39;ll make Leo pay dearly.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.095" end="00:07:36.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Everyone, we may be out of</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.215" end="00:07:38.295" style="s2">food and water, but Zhao&#39;s rescue team</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.295" end="00:07:40.175" style="s2">will be here any minute. Meanwhile,</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.295" end="00:07:43.975" style="s2">we&#39;ve kicked Leo out and he&#39;s probably</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.175" end="00:07:43.975" style="s2">hiding somewhere shaking in his boots.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.055" end="00:07:57.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.255" end="00:07:57.135" style="s2">How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.055" end="00:08:04.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding. Congratulations, host. You caught</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.215" end="00:08:06.295" style="s2">a black sea bream. Fish entry reward</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.375" end="00:08:07.977" style="s2">unlocked. One durable vest. Ding.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.295" end="00:08:10.177" style="s2">Congratulations, host. You caught a sea</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.977" end="00:08:12.217" style="s2">bass. New fish entry added. Fish entry</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.177" end="00:08:14.257" style="s2">reward unlocked. One waterproof tent.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.217" end="00:08:16.257" style="s2">Ding. Congratulations, host. You caught</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.257" end="00:08:18.337" style="s2">a blue-spotted mackerel. New fish entry</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.257" end="00:08:19.297" style="s2">added. Reward unlocked. Three magnesium</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.337" end="00:08:21.137" style="s2">fire starters.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.297" end="00:08:22.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That should do it. With these supplies,</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.137" end="00:08:24.417" style="s2">I can manage even if the rescue team</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.657" end="00:08:27.257" style="s2">doesn&#39;t make it tonight. I can hold out</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.417" end="00:08:27.257" style="s2">for quite a while.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.537" end="00:08:32.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, that fish is huge.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.577" end="00:08:34.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no way Lin Yu can eat it all.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.537" end="00:08:36.457" style="s2">It&#39;d be a waste to let it go bad.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.297" end="00:08:38.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. We&#39;re all classmates. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.457" end="00:08:39.977" style="s2">wrong with sharing some fish with us?</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.017" end="00:08:42.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I doubt Lin Yu wants things to get this</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.977" end="00:08:46.377" style="s2">ugly, either. Let&#39;s go ask him for some</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.137" end="00:08:46.377" style="s2">food and water. He won&#39;t turn us down.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.217" end="00:09:04.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? You just got beaten up. Looking to</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.417" end="00:09:07.137" style="s2">get slapped around again?</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.777" end="00:09:09.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu, show some goodwill. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.137" end="00:09:11.937" style="s2">eat that whole fish, so share half with</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.457" end="00:09:13.417" style="s2">us. That&#39;s not asking much.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.937" end="00:09:15.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should I share it with you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.417" end="00:09:18.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because we&#39;re classmates. We should help</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.537" end="00:09:18.177" style="s2">each other.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.457" end="00:09:25.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help each other?</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.897" end="00:09:28.097" style="s2">Who kicked me out without even hearing</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.817" end="00:09:29.977" style="s2">me out? Where was all that talk of</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.097" end="00:09:32.377" style="s2">friendship and helping each other then?</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.977" end="00:09:34.497" style="s2">You&#39;ve already kicked me out. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.377" end="00:09:36.457" style="s2">one of your classmates anymore. So, this</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.497" end="00:09:36.897" style="s2">fish and water have nothing to do with</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.457" end="00:09:39.337" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.897" end="00:09:40.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll give you 1,000 for the fish. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.337" end="00:09:42.857" style="s2">a generous offer, isn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.897" end="00:09:44.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5,000. I&#39;ll give you 5,000.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.857" end="00:09:45.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take the fish and that case of</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.137" end="00:09:47.337" style="s2">water. That&#39;s my final offer.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.817" end="00:09:49.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu, don&#39;t push your luck. When my</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.337" end="00:09:51.017" style="s2">rescue team gets here, all your supplies</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.017" end="00:09:51.897" style="s2">will be worthless. Then you&#39;ll be sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.017" end="00:09:53.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.897" end="00:09:55.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never seen anyone as selfish and</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.617" end="00:09:57.097" style="s2">petty as Lin Yu. So, what if you got</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.417" end="00:09:58.297" style="s2">lucky and caught a fish? Now he&#39;s gotten</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.097" end="00:09:59.537" style="s2">way too full of himself.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.297" end="00:10:01.057" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing we saw what he was really</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.537" end="00:10:02.897" style="s2">like and kicked him out of the group.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.057" end="00:10:04.257" style="s2">People like him are nothing but trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.897" end="00:10:04.857" style="s2">We&#39;d have regretted keeping him.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.257" end="00:10:06.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ciao.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.857" end="00:10:08.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When your rescue team gets here, we</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.377" end="00:10:10.258" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t take Lin Yu with us. Leave him</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.137" end="00:10:11.218" style="s2">on this island to starve and freeze to</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.258" end="00:10:13.698" style="s2">death.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.218" end="00:10:15.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. When the rescue team arrives,</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.698" end="00:10:17.538" style="s2">nobody helps him. Let&#39;s see how long he</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.578" end="00:10:19.778" style="s2">lasts without all of us.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.538" end="00:10:21.138" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many days can he survive on his own?</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.778" end="00:10:23.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough arguing.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.138" end="00:10:25.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has anyone noticed it&#39;s getting colder?</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.018" end="00:10:27.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It feels like it&#39;s below 25° C now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.818" end="00:10:29.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Given how much the temperature changes</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.298" end="00:10:31.098" style="s2">here, it must be past 10:00 p.m.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.418" end="00:10:32.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao, you said your professional rescue</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.098" end="00:10:33.778" style="s2">team would be here tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.298" end="00:10:35.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why haven&#39;t we heard from them?</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.778" end="00:10:37.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush? My watch has automatic</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.458" end="00:10:38.818" style="s2">GPS, so it definitely sent out a signal.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.458" end="00:10:40.538" style="s2">The seas are rough. It&#39;ll take the</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.818" end="00:10:42.338" style="s2">rescue team time to get here, but I</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.538" end="00:10:44.618" style="s2">promise you, before dawn, they&#39;ll find</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.338" end="00:10:47.258" style="s2">this island AND GET US ALL OFF IT.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.618" end="00:10:49.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enjoy your little victory, Lin Yu. When</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.258" end="00:10:50.698" style="s2">the rescue team gets here tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.058" end="00:10:53.218" style="s2">we&#39;ll see how long you keep running your</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.698" end="00:10:53.218" style="s2">mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.858" end="00:11:03.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Yu, where&#39;s that rescue team you</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.618" end="00:11:04.618" style="s2">promised? It&#39;s already morning. Were you</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.018" end="00:11:07.738" style="s2">PLAYING US?</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.618" end="00:11:07.738" style="s2">I&#39;M YELLING AT YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.578" end="00:11:20.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAIT. LOOK. WATER. It&#39;s water. Something</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.418" end="00:11:21.338" style="s2">must have washed ashore last night.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.298" end="00:11:22.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.338" end="00:11:22.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.298" end="00:11:24.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.738" end="00:11:26.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the water?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.498" end="00:11:27.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S WATER. A WHOLE CASE OF IT.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.618" end="00:11:29.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S EXACTLY THE SAME AS THE BOX THAT</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.898" end="00:11:31.458" style="s2">GOT SWALLOWED BY A FISH EARLIER.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.418" end="00:11:33.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GREAT. With this box of water, we can</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.458" end="00:11:35.618" style="s2">each get at least a small share. Enough</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.778" end="00:11:38.018" style="s2">to hold out until the rescue team gets</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.618" end="00:11:38.018" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.778" end="00:11:50.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why were there only three bottles?</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.818" end="00:11:51.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A whole box of water and only three</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.658" end="00:11:53.138" style="s2">bottles are left.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.458" end="00:11:54.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So many people and only three bottles of</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.138" end="00:11:56.658" style="s2">water. How are we supposed to split</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.778" end="00:11:57.978" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.658" end="00:11:59.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t panic, everyone. Let&#39;s get the</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.978" end="00:12:00.858" style="s2">rules straight. Brother Zhao dug up this</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.418" end="00:12:02.258" style="s2">box of water. He deserves the most</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.858" end="00:12:03.698" style="s2">credit. So, the first bottle goes to</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.258" end="00:12:04.658" style="s2">Brother Zhao. Any objections?</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.698" end="00:12:05.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The other two bottles should naturally</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.658" end="00:12:07.018" style="s2">go to the loyal, reliable people who&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.978" end="00:12:08.218" style="s2">been following Brother Zhao.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.018" end="00:12:11.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t just hand them over to</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.218" end="00:12:13.979" style="s2">outsiders who didn&#39;t lift a finger.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.498" end="00:12:15.419" style="s2"> OFF. MY WATER. WHO THE HELL ARE YOU</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.979" end="00:12:17.379" style="s2">TO DECIDE WHAT HAPPENS TO IT?</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.419" end="00:12:19.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen up. I paid to charter this whole</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.379" end="00:12:21.339" style="s2">cruise ship. Everything on board,</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.259" end="00:12:23.579" style="s2">including this water that washed ashore,</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.339" end="00:12:25.379" style="s2">is all my personal property. Anyone who</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.579" end="00:12:26.979" style="s2">dares touch it without my permission</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.379" end="00:12:29.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t blame me if I get rough. And don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.979" end="00:12:29.699" style="s2">go saying I told you and bullying</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.019" end="00:12:31.859" style="s2">anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.699" end="00:12:34.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An Yue found this water, so this bottle</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.859" end="00:12:36.739" style="s2">goes to her. As for the rest of you,</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.259" end="00:12:41.179" style="s2">just wait patiently. Once my rescue team</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.739" end="00:12:41.179" style="s2">arrives, you&#39;ll all have water to drink.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.179" end="00:13:04.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING?</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.659" end="00:13:05.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ZHAO ARE YOU TRYING TO MUTINY?</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.139" end="00:13:08.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;VE GOT it wrong, brother Zhao.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.659" end="00:13:10.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just saying, it&#39;s almost noon.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.139" end="00:13:12.059" style="s2">If we stay out here like this I&#39;m afraid</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.259" end="00:13:13.579" style="s2">that before the rescue team arrives</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.059" end="00:13:14.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll all be sun dried and dehydrated</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.579" end="00:13:17.659" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.659" end="00:13:17.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do you suggest?</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.859" end="00:13:20.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin You&#39;s actually pretty smart. He knew</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.459" end="00:13:22.139" style="s2">no one could stand this heat, so he</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.899" end="00:13:22.979" style="s2">slipped into the woods to cool off a</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.139" end="00:13:24.379" style="s2">long time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.979" end="00:13:25.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Zhao, since your watch has</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.379" end="00:13:26.819" style="s2">location tracking</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.259" end="00:13:28.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So even if we go onto the island, the</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.819" end="00:13:30.139" style="s2">rescue team will still find us, right?</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.419" end="00:13:30.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, they&#39;ll find us by the end</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.139" end="00:13:32.379" style="s2">of the day.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.659" end="00:13:33.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since that&#39;s settled, I say we all head</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.379" end="00:13:35.979" style="s2">onto the island to get out of the sun.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.819" end="00:13:37.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Besides, this island is huge. There</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.979" end="00:13:38.979" style="s2">might even be a stream or another</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.419" end="00:13:42.859" style="s2">natural water source inland.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.979" end="00:13:42.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what ARE WE WAITING FOR? LET&#39;S GO.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.419" end="00:13:51.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S BEEN A FULL day and night. We</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.659" end="00:13:52.539" style="s2">haven&#39;t seen a sign of that rescue team</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.339" end="00:13:55.979" style="s2">Zhao Yu promised.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.539" end="00:13:55.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;d better prepare for the worst.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.939" end="00:14:05.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, please. We&#39;re begging you. Could</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.539" end="00:14:09.179" style="s2">you spare us some water? Just a little,</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.739" end="00:14:09.179" style="s2">enough to wet our throats.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.099" end="00:14:12.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.979" end="00:14:19.781" style="s2">Still, I&#39;m not a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.581" end="00:14:22.581" style="s2">If you can get me what I need,</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.781" end="00:14:23.901" style="s2">I&#39;ll trade you water and food for it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.581" end="00:14:25.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember seeing some buckets like that</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.901" end="00:14:27.301" style="s2">yesterday when we salvaged the wreckage.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.781" end="00:14:30.381" style="s2">They should still be on that beach, and</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.301" end="00:14:32.501" style="s2">they ought to be usable.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.381" end="00:14:34.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, do you get a kick out of</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.501" end="00:14:36.421" style="s2">ordering us around? We&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.301" end="00:14:37.301" style="s2">classmates. What you&#39;re doing is way out</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.421" end="00:14:39.861" style="s2">of line.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.301" end="00:14:42.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A fair trade is only natural. I provide</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.861" end="00:14:43.381" style="s2">the supplies, you do the work. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.381" end="00:14:45.661" style="s2">fair.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.381" end="00:14:47.901" style="s2">Or is our righteous class monitor too</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.661" end="00:14:49.621" style="s2">good to work for it? Maybe she&#39;d rather</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.901" end="00:14:51.061" style="s2">offer something else in exchange for</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.621" end="00:14:53.541" style="s2">water and food.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.061" end="00:14:55.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, you pervert! How could you say</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.541" end="00:14:57.421" style="s2">something like that?</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.181" end="00:14:59.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.421" end="00:15:02.741" style="s2">That&#39;s what you all think of me anyway,</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.181" end="00:15:06.181" style="s2">right? What&#39;s so surprising?</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.741" end="00:15:06.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, don&#39;t push your luck.</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.981" end="00:15:20.021" style="s2">Ling Yu, we found the bucket. Can we</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.421" end="00:15:20.021" style="s2">trade it for water and food now?</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.021" end="00:15:34.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pervert!</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.621" end="00:15:34.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE YOU DOING? STOP IT!</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.061" end="00:15:43.221" style="s2">WHAT THE HELL IS THIS? IT DOESN&#39;T EVEN</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.261" end="00:15:43.821" style="s2">TASTE SALTY. IS THIS EVEN FIT FOR PEOPLE</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.221" end="00:15:45.661" style="s2">to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.821" end="00:15:47.741" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve given you what you came for. Now</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.661" end="00:15:50.341" style="s2">leave, and stop making a scene outside</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.741" end="00:15:52.181" style="s2">my cave.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.341" end="00:15:55.341" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um Ling Yu,</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.181" end="00:15:57.701" style="s2">could I stay with you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.341" end="00:15:59.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shang Wan Yu, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.701" end="00:16:02.021" style="s2">She actually wants to stay with a loser</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.261" end="00:16:03.701" style="s2">like Ling Yu?</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.021" end="00:16:05.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wan Yu, you should think this through.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.701" end="00:16:07.101" style="s2">My rescue team will be here soon. It</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.501" end="00:16:09.021" style="s2">won&#39;t be long. We&#39;ll all get off this</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.101" end="00:16:10.621" style="s2">island safely. If you go with Ling Yu</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.021" end="00:16:11.821" style="s2">and something happens, don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.621" end="00:16:14.581" style="s2">running to me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.821" end="00:16:16.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, but I don&#39;t feel well. I just</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.581" end="00:16:20.382" style="s2">need somewhere to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.101" end="00:16:20.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I hope you don&#39;t regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.822" end="00:16:29.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember you were Zhao Yu&#39;s biggest</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.422" end="00:16:30.302" style="s2">admirer back in school. Why not keep</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.382" end="00:16:32.302" style="s2">kissing up to him?</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.302" end="00:16:34.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only admire Zhao Yu&#39;s money, but out</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.302" end="00:16:36.022" style="s2">here on a deserted island, it&#39;s useless.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.622" end="00:16:37.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you afraid Zhao Yu might leave</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.022" end="00:16:39.702" style="s2">you behind when the rescue team arrives?</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.902" end="00:16:41.582" style="s2">Then you&#39;ll really have nowhere to turn.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.702" end="00:16:43.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am, but we&#39;ve already been waiting</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.582" end="00:16:46.622" style="s2">here for a full day and night. Something</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.822" end="00:16:48.342" style="s2">tells me the rescue team may never come.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.622" end="00:16:49.262" style="s2">Not before we die of thirst or hunger,</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.342" end="00:16:50.782" style="s2">anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.262" end="00:16:52.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re smarter than the others, at</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.782" end="00:16:54.302" style="s2">least. But if you want to stay here,</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.822" end="00:16:58.062" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t you ask me first?</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.302" end="00:16:58.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao, what are you going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.102" end="00:17:03.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.382" end="00:17:06.222" style="s2">Whatever I have in mind can wait until</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.662" end="00:17:06.222" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.262" end="00:17:22.822" style="s2">Drink this bottle of water, then you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.302" end="00:17:25.342" style="s2">have to work for me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.822" end="00:17:28.182" style="s2">Of course, you can say no.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.342" end="00:17:28.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll drink.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.902" end="00:17:37.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, your instincts were right.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.662" end="00:17:39.702" style="s2">There&#39;s a good chance Zhao Yu&#39;s rescue</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.542" end="00:17:42.222" style="s2">team will never find us.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.702" end="00:17:45.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never find us? How is that possible? Lin</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.222" end="00:17:45.502" style="s2">Yao, are you joking?</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.382" end="00:17:49.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should show you exactly what we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.662" end="00:17:51.222" style="s2">dealing with. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.702" end="00:17:53.462" style="s2">There&#39;s something I want you to see.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.222" end="00:17:54.422" style="s2">Something that shouldn&#39;t exist in this</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.462" end="00:17:57.062" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.422" end="00:17:58.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This place is way too remote. Lin Yao,</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.062" end="00:18:00.622" style="s2">he brought me somewhere this remote out</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.422" end="00:18:02.062" style="s2">of nowhere. What if he tries something?</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.622" end="00:18:05.502" style="s2">I&#39;m all alone.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.062" end="00:18:05.502" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t be able to fight him off.</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.062" end="00:18:11.462" style="s2">Lin Yao, don&#39;t. If you try anything,</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.662" end="00:18:13.542" style="s2">it&#39;s against the law. Even on a deserted</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.462" end="00:18:17.142" style="s2">island.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.542" end="00:18:17.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you even talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.063" end="00:18:29.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep going, everyone. The soil&#39;s much</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.103" end="00:18:31.183" style="s2">wetter here than it was before. That</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.703" end="00:18:32.743" style="s2">means we must be close to a water</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.183" end="00:18:36.423" style="s2">source.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.743" end="00:18:36.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, that&#39;s right. Come on, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.383" end="00:18:41.903" style="s2">Look, a frog.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.303" end="00:18:43.503" style="s2">It&#39;s a little flaw, but it&#39;ll still help</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.903" end="00:18:45.303" style="s2">fill us up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.503" end="00:18:49.343" style="s2">DON&#39;T TOUCH IT. THAT&#39;S A POISON DART</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.303" end="00:18:49.343" style="s2">FROG. ONE TOUCH COULD KILL YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.623" end="00:18:56.783" style="s2">I touched a poison dart frog. I&#39;M GOING</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.063" end="00:18:56.783" style="s2">TO DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.748" end="00:18:59.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.663" end="00:19:02.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RUN.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.503" end="00:19:06.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, NO, STAY BACK. JOE, help me, please.</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.983" end="00:19:06.143" style="s2">You&#39;ve got to help me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.863" end="00:19:14.063" style="s2">GET AWAY FROM ME. DON&#39;T GET YOUR FILTHY</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.863" end="00:19:14.063" style="s2">MESS ON ME. I&#39;M NOT READY TO DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.903" end="00:19:24.503" style="s2">I DIDN&#39;T DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.863" end="00:19:25.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s up? Didn&#39;t you say one touch</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.503" end="00:19:27.863" style="s2">would kill you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.703" end="00:19:29.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, you nearly scared us to death.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.863" end="00:19:31.103" style="s2">Does he even know what he&#39;s talking</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.143" end="00:19:33.023" style="s2">about?</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.103" end="00:19:35.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just remembered, poison dart frog</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.023" end="00:19:36.703" style="s2">toxins enter the bloodstream. So, unless</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.063" end="00:19:39.663" style="s2">you have an open cut, you usually won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.703" end="00:19:39.663" style="s2">die from touching one.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.943" end="00:19:46.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.663" end="00:19:55.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Judging by this groove, a snake</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.503" end="00:19:57.103" style="s2">slithered through here. According to</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.183" end="00:19:59.343" style="s2">current scientific records, even the</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.103" end="00:20:01.463" style="s2">largest anacondas in the Amazon aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.343" end="00:20:03.143" style="s2">more than 40 cm wide.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.463" end="00:20:04.303" style="s2">But, this track in front of us is nearly</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.143" end="00:20:06.343" style="s2">a meter wide.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.303" end="00:20:08.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could someone have made it?</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.343" end="00:20:11.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on. I was only talking about snakes</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.743" end="00:20:14.423" style="s2">that exist today.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.543" end="00:20:14.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.743" end="00:20:20.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you know there was a prehistoric</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.223" end="00:20:22.383" style="s2">creature called the Titanoboa?</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.463" end="00:20:24.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think I&#39;ve seen a Titanoboa in a</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.383" end="00:20:26.025" style="s2">movie, but didn&#39;t they go extinct ages</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.825" end="00:20:28.025" style="s2">ago?</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.025" end="00:20:30.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what I thought, too. But, only a</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.025" end="00:20:31.825" style="s2">snake like that could leave tracks like</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.025" end="00:20:33.465" style="s2">these. I brought you here to show you</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.825" end="00:20:35.425" style="s2">this for a reason. This isn&#39;t just some</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.465" end="00:20:37.425" style="s2">ordinary deserted island. It may not</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.425" end="00:20:38.825" style="s2">even be on any known map. No scientific</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.425" end="00:20:41.385" style="s2">expedition has ever discovered this</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.825" end="00:20:44.865" style="s2">island. Given that, do you think Joel&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.385" end="00:20:44.865" style="s2">rescue team can find us?</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.649" end="00:20:57.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.945" end="00:21:05.585" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao, don&#39;t get the wrong idea. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.865" end="00:21:07.345" style="s2">not here to steal your stuff. One of our</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.585" end="00:21:07.865" style="s2">classmates was poisoned. We need you to</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.345" end="00:21:10.945" style="s2">help him.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.865" end="00:21:14.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The good ones are all dead. Why are you</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.945" end="00:21:17.025" style="s2">asking me to save anyone? A corpse.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.905" end="00:21:19.185" style="s2">An Yue, look closely.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.025" end="00:21:21.585" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t saved you yesterday, you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.185" end="00:21:22.865" style="s2">be just like him now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.585" end="00:21:25.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.865" end="00:21:26.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE! SOMEONE! THE RESCUE TEAM&#39;S HERE</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.505" end="00:21:30.865" style="s2">TO SAVE US!</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.825" end="00:21:30.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The rescue team? Where?</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.545" end="00:21:38.105" style="s2">Lin Yao, the rescue team&#39;s here. Aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.785" end="00:21:39.785" style="s2">you leaving?</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.105" end="00:21:43.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can leave if you want, but don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.785" end="00:21:43.265" style="s2">expect to come back so easily.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.545" end="00:21:48.665" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.665" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After what you showed me earlier, how</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.665" end="00:21:53.665" style="s2">could I leave? The rescue team showed up</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.705" end="00:21:56.985" style="s2">so suddenly. Something feels off. I hope</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.665" end="00:21:56.985" style="s2">I&#39;m just being paranoid.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.505" end="00:22:08.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE THE HELL IS EVERYONE? ARE YOU</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.505" end="00:22:10.825" style="s2"> BLIND? Are you messing with us</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.345" end="00:22:12.425" style="s2">on purpose? I swear, I&#39;m not lying. I</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.825" end="00:22:13.665" style="s2">really saw someone over there, but they</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.425" end="00:22:15.945" style="s2">vanished in a second.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.665" end="00:22:17.385" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t lose hope. If we saw someone, it</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.945" end="00:22:18.905" style="s2">must have been the rescue team. The</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.385" end="00:22:20.225" style="s2">vegetation&#39;s so thick, they probably</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.905" end="00:22:20.985" style="s2">didn&#39;t see us. They must have gone</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.225" end="00:22:22.505" style="s2">somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.985" end="00:22:26.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. If we follow them in this</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.505" end="00:22:26.106" style="s2">direction, we&#39;ll be rescued for sure.</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.666" end="00:22:38.506" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this where we started? Why are we</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.786" end="00:22:39.706" style="s2">back here?</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.506" end="00:22:40.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell kind of directions are you</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.706" end="00:22:41.746" style="s2">giving us?</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.466" end="00:22:42.426" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But but I remember seeing someone head</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.746" end="00:22:43.986" style="s2">this way.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.426" end="00:22:45.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Stop arguing.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.986" end="00:22:46.826" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We must have been mistaken. If that</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.306" end="00:22:49.546" style="s2">really was a rescue team, why isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.826" end="00:22:51.186" style="s2">there a single ship out at sea?</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.546" end="00:22:52.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.186" end="00:22:53.226" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dolly, you&#39;ve been lying to us this</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.586" end="00:22:54.786" style="s2">whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.226" end="00:22:55.786" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE IS NO RESCUE TEAM, is there?</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.786" end="00:22:57.226" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU NEVER SENT ONE.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.786" end="00:23:00.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.226" end="00:23:00.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU WANT TO DIE?</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.386" end="00:23:05.386" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look around. In this heat</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.106" end="00:23:06.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have no food or water. If we wait any</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.386" end="00:23:08.546" style="s2">longer, we&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.866" end="00:23:09.746" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m done waiting here like an idiot. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.546" end="00:23:11.106" style="s2">going to join LIN YU.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.746" end="00:23:12.386" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S RIGHT. LIN YU IS THE ONLY ONE</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.106" end="00:23:13.346" style="s2">WITH FOOD and water. He&#39;s the only one</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.386" end="00:23:15.146" style="s2">who can keep us alive.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.346" end="00:23:17.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu took seven years. He&#39;ll take us</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.146" end="00:23:17.546" style="s2">in, too.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.426" end="00:23:23.746" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? Lin Yu is a good guy. He wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.426" end="00:23:25.786" style="s2">leave us TO FEND FOR OURSELVES.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.746" end="00:23:26.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YEAH, LIN Yu is so kind. We were wrong</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.786" end="00:23:28.146" style="s2">about him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.506" end="00:23:31.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu, we we&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.146" end="00:23:34.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. Get this eyesore out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.986" end="00:23:36.786" style="s2">Then get lost and don&#39;t come back.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.906" end="00:23:37.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu, you&#39;ve got it wrong. Liu Weiwei</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.786" end="00:23:39.426" style="s2">was the one who kicked you out</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.626" end="00:23:42.746" style="s2">yesterday. We had nothing to do with it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.426" end="00:23:45.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We really came here to join you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.746" end="00:23:45.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t say it again.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.426" end="00:23:51.386" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dolly, keep Lin Yu busy while I grab a</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.186" end="00:23:54.226" style="s2">few BOTTLES OF WATER. THEN WE RUN.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.386" end="00:23:57.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few bottles? Forget that. I&#39;m taking</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.226" end="00:23:57.146" style="s2">the whole case.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.026" end="00:24:02.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Lin Yu&#39;s water. You can&#39;t take</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.346" end="00:24:05.866" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.866" end="00:24:07.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little punk.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.866" end="00:24:08.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Lin</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.066" end="00:24:11.066" style="s2">I mean</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.146" end="00:24:11.066" style="s2">Master Lin.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.386" end="00:24:16.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, host. You caught a</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.026" end="00:24:19.466" style="s2">sandfish. New entry added to the fish</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.626" end="00:24:20.746" style="s2">guide. Reward, one kettle.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.466" end="00:24:22.026" style="s2">Congratulations, host. You caught a</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.746" end="00:24:23.786" style="s2">dovi. All fish have been added to the</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.026" end="00:24:26.146" style="s2">collection. Collection reward received.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.786" end="00:24:27.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How cups of grace be instant noodles.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.146" end="00:24:29.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, host. You caught a</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.466" end="00:24:30.747" style="s2">halibut. The new fish have been added to</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.028" end="00:24:33.067" style="s2">the collection. Reward, one free water</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.747" end="00:24:34.987" style="s2">filter.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.067" end="00:24:36.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with Ling Yao? We&#39;re all stranded</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.987" end="00:24:37.747" style="s2">on this island. So, how come she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.467" end="00:24:39.187" style="s2">living so comfortably?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.747" end="00:24:40.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And that Su Wanin, begging for</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.187" end="00:24:41.827" style="s2">scraps the second she sees something to</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.427" end="00:24:43.307" style="s2">gain. Wonder what she gave up to stay by</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.827" end="00:24:44.107" style="s2">Ling Yao&#39;s side. She&#39;s pathetic and</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.307" end="00:24:45.427" style="s2">disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.107" end="00:24:47.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There seem to be plenty of fish around</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.427" end="00:24:47.788" style="s2">here. Ling Yao&#39;s already caught quite a</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.028" end="00:24:50.028" style="s2">few.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.788" end="00:24:52.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think we could learn to fish like him?</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.028" end="00:24:54.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why bother fishing, YOU SHORT-SIGHTED</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.107" end="00:24:56.028" style="s2">FOOLS? ONCE MY RESCUE TEAM GETS HERE,</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.347" end="00:24:57.788" style="s2">we&#39;ll have deep-sea lobster, oysters,</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.028" end="00:24:59.507" style="s2">abalone, every kind of seafood. Why</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.788" end="00:25:00.268" style="s2">waste time catching little fish? It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.507" end="00:25:02.227" style="s2">pointless.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.268" end="00:25:03.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Yu, can you actually deliver? Ever</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.227" end="00:25:05.028" style="s2">since we got here, you&#39;ve kept saying</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.347" end="00:25:07.028" style="s2">the rescue team is coming, and we&#39;ve all</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.028" end="00:25:08.947" style="s2">been starving because of you. But, where</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.028" end="00:25:10.067" style="s2">are they? There&#39;s no sign of them. How</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.947" end="00:25:10.627" style="s2">much longer are you going to keep lying</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.067" end="00:25:12.707" style="s2">to us?</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.627" end="00:25:13.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You! I&#39;LL SHOW YOU EXACTLY WHAT I&#39;M</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.707" end="00:25:15.187" style="s2">CAPABLE OF.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.427" end="00:25:17.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ZHAO, CALM DOWN. WE NEVER said your</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.187" end="00:25:19.987" style="s2">rescue team wasn&#39;t coming. Zhao, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.908" end="00:25:21.707" style="s2">you like An Yue? She&#39;s watching.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.987" end="00:25:24.227" style="s2">It&#39;d look bad if you laid a hand on Liu</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.707" end="00:25:24.227" style="s2">Weiwei.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.028" end="00:25:32.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Either way, I don&#39;t know how to fish.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.987" end="00:25:33.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Zhao. You shouldn&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.467" end="00:25:35.347" style="s2">do the hard work. Just sit back and</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.947" end="00:25:35.747" style="s2">wait, and enjoy the food when it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.347" end="00:25:37.347" style="s2">ready.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.747" end="00:25:38.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone stay calm. Since help isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.347" end="00:25:40.467" style="s2">coming just yet, we need to figure out</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.707" end="00:25:42.307" style="s2">how to survive. From now on, everyone</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.467" end="00:25:43.467" style="s2">split up and get to work. I had them</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.307" end="00:25:45.268" style="s2">gather branches and vines to make a</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.467" end="00:25:47.707" style="s2">basic fishing rod. Then we headed out to</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.268" end="00:25:47.707" style="s2">fish.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.987" end="00:25:55.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, quit digging. Come fishing with me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.987" end="00:25:56.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you crazy? How are we supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.707" end="00:25:57.668" style="s2">fish without bait?</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.627" end="00:25:59.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would you know? I&#39;ve watched Ling</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.668" end="00:26:00.148" style="s2">Yao fish for ages. Did you know he</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.067" end="00:26:02.148" style="s2">hasn&#39;t used bait once?</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.148" end="00:26:02.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously? You can actually catch fish</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.148" end="00:26:04.307" style="s2">without bait?</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.908" end="00:26:05.388" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw it with my own eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.307" end="00:26:06.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe the fish around here aren&#39;t very</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.388" end="00:26:07.547" style="s2">bright. How else do you think Ling Yao</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.747" end="00:26:09.028" style="s2">caught so many?</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.547" end="00:26:10.788" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we keep wasting time with them, it&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.028" end="00:26:12.107" style="s2">be dark soon. I could use a hand. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.788" end="00:26:13.227" style="s2">catch some fish now, and fill our</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.107" end="00:26:16.347" style="s2">bellies without sharing with everyone</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.227" end="00:26:16.347" style="s2">else. It&#39;s a win-win.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.908" end="00:26:32.389" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Salt. It&#39;s salt. Ling Yao, we&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.789" end="00:26:34.229" style="s2">salt.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.389" end="00:26:35.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t just have salt.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.229" end="00:26:39.789" style="s2">We&#39;ve got this machine, too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.789" end="00:26:39.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now our water problem&#39;s solved, too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.669" end="00:26:53.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, you&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.269" end="00:26:55.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.749" end="00:26:58.149" style="s2">What makes me so amazing? Go on, tell</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.909" end="00:26:58.149" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.469" end="00:27:04.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET OUT! GET OUT! HELP ME!</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.269" end="00:27:04.949" style="s2">GET OUT! GET OUT!</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.418" end="00:27:05.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.949" end="00:27:08.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELP!</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.149" end="00:27:08.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET OUT! GET OUT!</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.029" end="00:27:13.589" style="s2">WHY ARE YOU BACK?</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.149" end="00:27:16.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEO, we&#39;re not here to cause trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.589" end="00:27:16.869" style="s2">It&#39;s Dong Wei. Dong Wei, the two of them</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.269" end="00:27:18.029" style="s2">are missing.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.869" end="00:27:20.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re missing?</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.029" end="00:27:23.269" style="s2">What does that have to do with me? Leo.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.229" end="00:27:27.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re all classmates.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.269" end="00:27:27.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If that&#39;s all you&#39;ve got, you can leave.</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.389" end="00:27:32.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin, it&#39;s not that we absolutely need to</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.269" end="00:27:34.229" style="s2">find Dong Wei and the others. It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.149" end="00:27:36.029" style="s2">that they disappeared so suddenly. And</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.229" end="00:27:38.149" style="s2">I&#39;m worried there may be dangers on this</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.029" end="00:27:39.949" style="s2">island we don&#39;t know about.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.149" end="00:27:41.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So your real goal isn&#39;t to find Dong Wei</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.949" end="00:27:44.429" style="s2">and the others. You&#39;re using their</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.429" end="00:27:45.109" style="s2">disappearance as an excuse to ask me for</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.429" end="00:27:46.509" style="s2">protection.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.109" end="00:27:48.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who was it that wanted me kicked out in</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.509" end="00:27:51.629" style="s2">the first place? And now you have the</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.229" end="00:27:53.269" style="s2">nerve to come crawling back to me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.629" end="00:27:54.229" style="s2">Tell me exactly what happened to Dong</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.269" end="00:27:56.269" style="s2">Wei and the other guy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.229" end="00:27:57.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, here&#39;s what happened, Lin. We were</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.269" end="00:27:59.829" style="s2">all digging for bait in the woods this</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.789" end="00:28:01.309" style="s2">evening. I saw Dong Wei and his buddy</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.829" end="00:28:02.549" style="s2">sneak away, but I figured they&#39;d already</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.309" end="00:28:03.829" style="s2">dug up some bait, so I didn&#39;t think much</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.549" end="00:28:05.189" style="s2">of it. But when we got to the beach,</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.829" end="00:28:06.109" style="s2">neither of them was there. We still</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.189" end="00:28:07.629" style="s2">haven&#39;t found them.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.109" end="00:28:09.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you find anything on your way back</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.629" end="00:28:10.749" style="s2">to the beach? Anything like clothes,</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.349" end="00:28:12.149" style="s2">shoes, or a fishing rod?</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.749" end="00:28:13.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.149" end="00:28:14.829" style="s2">The whole way was clear. They left</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.869" end="00:28:16.349" style="s2">nothing behind.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.829" end="00:28:17.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s like Dong Wei and his buddy</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.349" end="00:28:20.109" style="s2">vanished into thin air.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.789" end="00:28:21.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s strange. If a wild animal</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.109" end="00:28:22.709" style="s2">attacked them, it would have left</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.629" end="00:28:24.589" style="s2">something behind.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.709" end="00:28:25.949" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe they were fishing and got dragged</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.589" end="00:28:27.909" style="s2">out to sea by a fish.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.949" end="00:28:29.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I doubt it. Dong Wei and his buddy only</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.909" end="00:28:30.629" style="s2">had one fishing rod.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.189" end="00:28:32.589" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if a fish dragged them into the</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.629" end="00:28:34.630" style="s2">water, how could it take them both?</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.589" end="00:28:36.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they didn&#39;t fall in by accident,</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.630" end="00:28:38.430" style="s2">there are only two possibilities. The</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.550" end="00:28:40.430" style="s2">first possibility, Jiang Wei and his</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.430" end="00:28:42.190" style="s2">buddy chose to leave the group. The</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.430" end="00:28:44.390" style="s2">second is that they ran into something</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.190" end="00:28:46.670" style="s2">more than an ordinary animal, something</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.390" end="00:28:48.870" style="s2">aggressive and smarter than most.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.670" end="00:28:51.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lei Yang, quit trying to scare me. You</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.870" end="00:28:52.590" style="s2">just want money, don&#39;t you? 20 grand,</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.150" end="00:28:54.310" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you 20 grand if you let me</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.590" end="00:28:57.230" style="s2">have the cave tonight. I&#39;ll transfer it</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.310" end="00:28:57.230" style="s2">as soon as we get back.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.590" end="00:29:02.670" style="s2">What kind of animal do you think it is?</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.510" end="00:29:03.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One that could take a person and their</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.670" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">fishing rod.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.670" end="00:29:08.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you heard of cannibals?</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.910" end="00:29:09.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cannibals?</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.070" end="00:29:12.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember that figure you saw this</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.750" end="00:29:13.710" style="s2">afternoon? I suspected it might be them</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.070" end="00:29:15.310" style="s2">even then.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.710" end="00:29:16.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have to be kidding, right? How could</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.310" end="00:29:18.230" style="s2">there be cannibals on this island?</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.950" end="00:29:20.030" style="s2">That&#39;s ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.230" end="00:29:22.630" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t believe me, you&#39;re free to</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.030" end="00:29:24.550" style="s2">leave. Then wait until dawn and see how</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.630" end="00:29:26.150" style="s2">many of you are still here. If I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.550" end="00:29:28.110" style="s2">right, Jiang Wei and the others were</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.150" end="00:29:30.070" style="s2">just the appetizer. Every one of you</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.110" end="00:29:32.270" style="s2">standing here is already on those</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.070" end="00:29:35.230" style="s2">cannibals&#39; radar.</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.270" end="00:29:36.830" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Lin, please, take me in.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.230" end="00:29:37.790" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lent you 10 yuan once. You can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.830" end="00:29:39.350" style="s2">LEAVE ME TO DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.790" end="00:29:41.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ME TOO, Lei Yang. I&#39;ve always thought</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.350" end="00:29:43.030" style="s2">you were the most reliable guy in class.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.390" end="00:29:44.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I remember right, when you asked to</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.030" end="00:29:47.310" style="s2">borrow money, you weren&#39;t too happy</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.750" end="00:29:49.430" style="s2">about it. Then you made me pay back 20</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.310" end="00:29:51.710" style="s2">yuan. And you, when you kicked me out</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.430" end="00:29:53.710" style="s2">yesterday, didn&#39;t you call me pathetic?</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.710" end="00:29:55.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why the sudden change of heart?</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.710" end="00:29:57.590" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lei Yang, that&#39;s all in the past. CAN</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.550" end="00:29:58.990" style="s2">YOU STOP HOLDING it against us?</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.590" end="00:30:01.430" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone else who interrupts me gets</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.990" end="00:30:02.870" style="s2">kicked out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.430" end="00:30:04.390" style="s2">I&#39;ve already taught him a lesson for</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.870" end="00:30:06.430" style="s2">you. Guess we&#39;re even now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.390" end="00:30:08.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s the deal. Take us in and share</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.430" end="00:30:09.550" style="s2">the supplies in the cave with us and</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.030" end="00:30:13.310" style="s2">I&#39;ll still pay you the 20 grand we</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.550" end="00:30:13.310" style="s2">agreed on when we get back.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.750" end="00:30:20.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.190" end="00:30:21.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.030" end="00:30:22.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take you in,</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.550" end="00:30:24.590" style="s2">but there&#39;s one condition.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.950" end="00:30:26.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the condition? Brother Lin,</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.590" end="00:30:26.990" style="s2">whatever it is, we&#39;ll do our best to</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.230" end="00:30:28.990" style="s2">make it happen.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.990" end="00:30:32.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s simple. The guys stay outside the</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.990" end="00:30:34.310" style="s2">cave. The girls stay at the entrance.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.150" end="00:30:35.270" style="s2">If anyone crosses the line, they&#39;re out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.310" end="00:30:37.032" style="s2">No warnings.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.270" end="00:30:39.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lei Yang, YOU BASTARD. YOU THINK YOU CAN</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.032" end="00:30:39.872" style="s2">SCREW ME OVER?</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.312" end="00:30:43.152" style="s2">IT&#39;S better than being stuck on an open</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.592" end="00:30:44.832" style="s2">beach.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.152" end="00:30:47.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are the terms. Take it or leave</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.832" end="00:30:49.392" style="s2">it. If anyone has a problem with that,</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.032" end="00:30:51.952" style="s2">you can leave now. Also, if you behave</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.392" end="00:30:53.872" style="s2">yourselves, I may provide water and food</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.952" end="00:30:55.712" style="s2">depending on how you do.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.872" end="00:30:56.792" style="s2">You&#39;ve been doing well so far. Here&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.712" end="00:31:00.872" style="s2">reward.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.792" end="00:31:02.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Lin. I&#39;ll behave. I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.872" end="00:31:05.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your loyalty to the emperor in the</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.912" end="00:31:05.512" style="s2">capital.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.832" end="00:31:15.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did I never notice before? Niu is</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.592" end="00:31:15.912" style="s2">actually pretty handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.192" end="00:31:20.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you looking at?</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.231" end="00:31:22.152" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. By the way, Ling Yun, why did</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.472" end="00:31:23.872" style="s2">you let everyone else move in? Aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.152" end="00:31:25.992" style="s2">you worried they might try something?</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.872" end="00:31:28.152" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They haven&#39;t eaten in 2 days. They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.992" end="00:31:29.872" style="s2">barely a threat. Besides, I have someone</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.152" end="00:31:31.752" style="s2">keeping an eye on them. As for why I let</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.872" end="00:31:33.231" style="s2">them stay, you don&#39;t think I was kidding</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.752" end="00:31:36.072" style="s2">about the cannibals, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.231" end="00:31:37.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.072" end="00:31:39.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s put that aside for now. Xia Lan</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.992" end="00:31:41.352" style="s2">Ning, you get better treatment than the</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.552" end="00:31:42.552" style="s2">others. Don&#39;t you think you should give</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.352" end="00:31:46.192" style="s2">something in return?</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.552" end="00:31:46.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I can be your cuddle buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.872" end="00:31:52.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yun, are you messing with us? It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.112" end="00:31:53.512" style="s2">been a whole night. Where are these</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.752" end="00:31:55.672" style="s2">cannibals?</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.512" end="00:31:59.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cannibals need to sleep at night, too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.672" end="00:32:00.632" style="s2">Or are you hoping they&#39;ll come knocking?</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.272" end="00:32:02.352" style="s2">Since you have fishing rods, come</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.632" end="00:32:03.832" style="s2">fishing with me. We&#39;ll catch our own</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.352" end="00:32:05.231" style="s2">food. You two stay here and guard the</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.832" end="00:32:07.072" style="s2">supplies. There&#39;s a big difference</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.231" end="00:32:08.471" style="s2">between one meal and eating every day.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.072" end="00:32:10.152" style="s2">I&#39;m sure you understand that.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.471" end="00:32:12.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Lin. We&#39;ll keep a close eye</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.152" end="00:32:12.912" style="s2">on everything.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.112" end="00:32:19.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding. Congratulations, host. A large</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.912" end="00:32:21.192" style="s2">yellow croaker has been added to the</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.072" end="00:32:24.032" style="s2">fish codex. Fish codex reward, dynamic</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.192" end="00:32:24.032" style="s2">vision enhanced.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.712" end="00:32:41.593" style="s2">How is there a knife inside this fish?</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.953" end="00:32:46.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe it swallowed it while it was</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.353" end="00:32:46.833" style="s2">feeding.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.553" end="00:32:50.793" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yao, was what you said true? The</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.313" end="00:32:52.953" style="s2">fishing rods we left on the beach last</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.793" end="00:32:55.873" style="s2">night are gone. Those cannibals must</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.953" end="00:32:55.873" style="s2">have done this again.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.353" end="00:33:00.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go. Take me to sea.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.113" end="00:33:09.073" style="s2">Let&#39;s check it out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.513" end="00:33:14.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yao, you You&#39;re not thinking of</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.713" end="00:33:16.513" style="s2">following those footprints, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.393" end="00:33:18.113" style="s2">They&#39;re cannibals. It&#39;s too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.513" end="00:33:19.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yao, it&#39;s been 2 DAYS. MY</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.113" end="00:33:19.753" style="s2">PROFESSIONAL rescue team will be here</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.393" end="00:33:21.273" style="s2">soon.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.753" end="00:33:23.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to get yourself killed,</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.273" end="00:33:24.033" style="s2">that&#39;s your business. Just don&#39;t drag us</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.233" end="00:33:27.553" style="s2">down with you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.033" end="00:33:27.553" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never asked you to come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.353" end="00:34:11.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t seriously think I&#39;m an idiot,</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.833" end="00:34:15.073" style="s2">can you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.873" end="00:34:15.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, let&#39;s head back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.433" end="00:34:36.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling, you&#39;re back. We saw the fish</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.153" end="00:34:37.793" style="s2">sitting in the bucket with no one</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.353" end="00:34:39.393" style="s2">looking after it, so we figured we&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.793" end="00:34:40.353" style="s2">roast it for you. We haven&#39;t touched a</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.393" end="00:34:44.394" style="s2">bite.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.353" end="00:34:44.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead. Eat as much as you want.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.474" end="00:34:51.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.034" end="00:35:05.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.074" end="00:35:09.034" style="s2">Pack everything up as quickly as you</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.554" end="00:35:09.034" style="s2">can. Then come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.834" end="00:35:22.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao, I was wrong to blame you for</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.314" end="00:35:23.314" style="s2">what happened. I&#39;m sorry. I really was</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.154" end="00:35:25.114" style="s2">wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.314" end="00:35:26.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Instead of apologizing, why don&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.114" end="00:35:27.794" style="s2">help me carry some more stuff?</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.314" end="00:35:29.674" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao, why are we moving all of a</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.794" end="00:35:31.114" style="s2">sudden? This cave is cool and close to</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.674" end="00:35:32.314" style="s2">the sea. What&#39;s wrong with it?</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.114" end="00:35:34.234" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A wise man doesn&#39;t put himself in</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.314" end="00:35:35.914" style="s2">danger. I went deep into the forest just</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.234" end="00:35:37.474" style="s2">now to find out exactly where those</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.914" end="00:35:38.594" style="s2">cannibals are and what they&#39;re up to.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.474" end="00:35:39.194" style="s2">They&#39;re celebrating around their camp</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.594" end="00:35:40.394" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.194" end="00:35:40.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obviously, because they just caught some</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.394" end="00:35:42.394" style="s2">prey.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.754" end="00:35:44.034" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For now, they have plenty to eat, but</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.394" end="00:35:45.474" style="s2">their food won&#39;t last forever.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.034" end="00:35:47.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When it runs out, do you think the cave</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.474" end="00:35:48.394" style="s2">to the east, so close to them, will</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.314" end="00:35:49.474" style="s2">still be safe?</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.394" end="00:35:50.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then where are we going?</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.474" end="00:35:52.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, on the very first day we got</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.954" end="00:35:54.554" style="s2">to the island, I found a spot halfway up</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.594" end="00:35:55.994" style="s2">that hill with a perfect natural cave.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.554" end="00:35:57.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s an ideal shelter. I didn&#39;t go there</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.994" end="00:35:59.154" style="s2">before because I still had hope Jiao</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.554" end="00:36:00.274" style="s2">Yu&#39;s rescue team would come. Plus,</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.154" end="00:36:01.954" style="s2">having to carry all the supplies by</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.274" end="00:36:02.714" style="s2">myself was a real pain.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.954" end="00:36:05.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But now,</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.714" end="00:36:05.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we have no choice.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.994" end="00:36:11.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Jiao, I can&#39;t shake this uneasy</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.314" end="00:36:13.914" style="s2">feeling. We just stole Lin Yao&#39;s fish.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.754" end="00:36:15.594" style="s2">What if he comes after us for it?</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.914" end="00:36:16.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you so scared of? It&#39;s just a</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.594" end="00:36:17.874" style="s2">lousy fish.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.554" end="00:36:19.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once my rescue team gets here, I&#39;ll give</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.874" end="00:36:20.834" style="s2">him more than just one fish. I&#39;ll give</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.314" end="00:36:21.754" style="s2">him two or three. He can take all the</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.834" end="00:36:23.834" style="s2">advantage he wants.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.754" end="00:36:25.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. They can&#39;t punish everyone for</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.834" end="00:36:27.834" style="s2">it. So many of us ate it. Lin Yao can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.794" end="00:36:29.194" style="s2">go after us one by one. Besides, he said</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.834" end="00:36:30.514" style="s2">we could eat as much as we wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.194" end="00:36:33.074" style="s2">Anyone who didn&#39;t eat it would be an</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.514" end="00:36:33.074" style="s2">idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.114" end="00:36:39.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.314" end="00:36:42.514" style="s2">Lin Yao tampered with</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.914" end="00:36:44.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re gone. They&#39;re really gone. THIS</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.514" end="00:36:46.436" style="s2">CAVE IS OURS NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.276" end="00:36:48.476" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t celebrate too soon.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.436" end="00:36:50.076" style="s2">Don&#39;t you think this is strange?</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.476" end="00:36:52.316" style="s2">Lin Yu wouldn&#39;t share his supplies with</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.076" end="00:36:55.356" style="s2">us before, but today he treated us to</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.316" end="00:36:58.036" style="s2">fish and left us this perfect shelter.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.356" end="00:36:59.796" style="s2">That&#39;s not like him at all. Wha- wait,</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.036" end="00:37:00.916" style="s2">this sounds like a last meal before an</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.796" end="00:37:02.676" style="s2">execution.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.916" end="00:37:04.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell are you talking about? I</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.676" end="00:37:07.156" style="s2">say Lin Yu knows when to back down. He</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.876" end="00:37:08.596" style="s2">must know my rescue team is almost here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.156" end="00:37:09.836" style="s2">That&#39;s why he backed down. He wants me</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.596" end="00:37:11.356" style="s2">to help him once I&#39;m rescued.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.836" end="00:37:12.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes sense. I knew there had to be</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.356" end="00:37:13.436" style="s2">a reason Lin Yu was suddenly so</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.836" end="00:37:14.796" style="s2">generous.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.436" end="00:37:16.796" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He should have known better. No one who</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.796" end="00:37:18.276" style="s2">crosses Brother Zhao ends well. Anyway,</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.796" end="00:37:19.836" style="s2">they gave up the cave, but where did Lin</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.276" end="00:37:21.916" style="s2">Yu and the others go? Who cares where</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.836" end="00:37:22.836" style="s2">they went? If they die out there, that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.916" end="00:37:24.316" style="s2">not my problem.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.836" end="00:37:26.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Zhao, Lin Yu&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.316" end="00:37:29.796" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s no big deal, but it looks like An</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.556" end="00:37:29.796" style="s2">Yue went with him, too.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.916" end="00:37:34.556" style="s2">This cave of Lin Yu&#39;s is in the perfect</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.236" end="00:37:36.356" style="s2">spot. We have the high ground, too. And</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.556" end="00:37:38.156" style="s2">there&#39;s only one way up the mountain.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.356" end="00:37:40.116" style="s2">Now, whether it&#39;s the cannibals or</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.156" end="00:37:42.676" style="s2">anyone else, they won&#39;t sneak up here so</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.116" end="00:37:42.676" style="s2">easily.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.036" end="00:37:46.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.596" end="00:37:48.396" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.676" end="00:37:51.876" style="s2">I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.396" end="00:37:51.876" style="s2">Can I have some food?</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.156" end="00:38:03.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have food, but you&#39;ll have to trade</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.276" end="00:38:03.076" style="s2">something of equal value for it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.116" end="00:38:08.876" style="s2">An Yue.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.196" end="00:38:08.876" style="s2">Have you decided what you&#39;re offering?</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.636" end="00:38:14.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; W- What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.156" end="00:38:17.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t decided exactly what I want</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.076" end="00:38:17.636" style="s2">yet, so you can owe me for now.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.796" end="00:38:27.556" style="s2">There&#39;s hot water over there. Go make</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.276" end="00:38:29.236" style="s2">yourself something. We&#39;re running low on</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.556" end="00:38:30.836" style="s2">firewood. You two, head down the</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.236" end="00:38:32.756" style="s2">mountain and gather some branches.</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.836" end="00:38:34.836" style="s2">Remember, only gather completely dry</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.756" end="00:38:36.596" style="s2">hardwood. Don&#39;t pick up anything damp,</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.836" end="00:38:37.716" style="s2">or the carbon monoxide from burning it</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.596" end="00:38:41.596" style="s2">could poison you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.716" end="00:38:41.596" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Lin. We won&#39;t get it wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.876" end="00:38:45.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu.</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.916" end="00:38:46.436" style="s2">The rescue team Zhao Yu promised isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.076" end="00:38:48.517" style="s2">coming, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.436" end="00:38:51.837" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already that, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.517" end="00:38:56.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just wanted to make sure.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.837" end="00:38:56.197" style="s2">Ling Yao, please don&#39;t leave me behind.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.597" end="00:39:01.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether I leave you behind</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.677" end="00:39:03.717" style="s2">depends on what you can offer me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.117" end="00:39:05.877" style="s2">Pouting won&#39;t get you anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.717" end="00:39:07.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m useful.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.877" end="00:39:10.677" style="s2">I can stay by your side and be your</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.877" end="00:39:12.757" style="s2">cuddle pillow every night.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.677" end="00:39:13.477" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not a little kid. I don&#39;t need a</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.757" end="00:39:15.197" style="s2">cuddle pillow.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.477" end="00:39:16.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A cuddle pillow?</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.197" end="00:39:17.437" style="s2">What&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.717" end="00:39:20.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.437" end="00:39:20.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How far have they gone?</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.797" end="00:39:29.357" style="s2">But you held me while we slept last</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.077" end="00:39:30.997" style="s2">night. You didn&#39;t push me away.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.357" end="00:39:32.557" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were the one who came over and</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.997" end="00:39:34.717" style="s2">cuddled up to me. I just couldn&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.557" end="00:39:36.317" style="s2">bothered to push you away.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.717" end="00:39:39.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what do you want? You don&#39;t want a</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.317" end="00:39:42.357" style="s2">cuddle pillow, and you&#39;re not a kid. So,</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.237" end="00:39:44.917" style="s2">wait. Are you asking me to have a baby</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.357" end="00:39:44.917" style="s2">with you?</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.597" end="00:39:50.837" style="s2">Right. Sorry. I&#39;ll find something to</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.077" end="00:39:50.837" style="s2">clean it up.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.597" end="00:39:58.797" style="s2">I don&#39;t have a fever. I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.677" end="00:40:01.517" style="s2">Ling Yao,</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.797" end="00:40:04.077" style="s2">if you really want a child, I can give</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.517" end="00:40:04.077" style="s2">you one.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.117" end="00:40:09.557" style="s2">I used to look up to Zhao Yu, but only</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.157" end="00:40:12.477" style="s2">because he was rich. I never let any</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.557" end="00:40:15.157" style="s2">other guy touch me. Ling Yao, I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.477" end="00:40:15.157" style="s2">tainted.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.437" end="00:40:18.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you think I&#39;m just some woman who</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.917" end="00:40:21.117" style="s2">thinks with her crotch?</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.637" end="00:40:23.157" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Ling Yao. That&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.117" end="00:40:24.837" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. You don&#39;t have to explain. You</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.157" end="00:40:26.357" style="s2">were the first to come with me. Just</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.837" end="00:40:28.317" style="s2">don&#39;t cause trouble and do as you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.357" end="00:40:30.597" style="s2">told. I won&#39;t kick you out.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.317" end="00:40:32.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is bad, Ling Yao. It suddenly got</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.597" end="00:40:35.197" style="s2">dark outside. Looks like a storm&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.677" end="00:40:35.197" style="s2">coming.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.517" end="00:40:40.757" style="s2">Why did it suddenly get so dark? Could a</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.597" end="00:40:42.717" style="s2">downpour be coming?</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.757" end="00:40:44.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what if it rains? We&#39;ve got caves to</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.717" end="00:40:46.237" style="s2">shelter in. What&#39;s there to worry about?</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.877" end="00:40:47.997" style="s2">Don&#39;t let your guard down. Weather on a</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.237" end="00:40:50.198" style="s2">deserted island can be extreme. After</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.997" end="00:40:51.318" style="s2">the storm, the temperature could plunge.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.198" end="00:40:53.358" style="s2">So, we need to gather plenty of</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.318" end="00:40:55.118" style="s2">firewood. What&#39;s the big deal? We just</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.358" end="00:40:56.998" style="s2">need something to start a fire. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.118" end="00:40:59.278" style="s2">plenty of it lying around. Just pick it</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.998" end="00:41:02.238" style="s2">up. Oh, these branches are all wet. They</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.278" end="00:41:02.238" style="s2">won&#39;t catch fire.</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.118" end="00:41:12.718" style="s2">Good work bringing back this firewood</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.838" end="00:41:13.318" style="s2">before the rain.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.718" end="00:41:14.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.318" end="00:41:15.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.318" end="00:41:17.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The weather at sea can change in an</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.838" end="00:41:19.718" style="s2">instant. This storm could bring far</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.598" end="00:41:20.838" style="s2">worse than just a drop in temperature.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.718" end="00:41:22.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did I tell you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.838" end="00:41:24.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So much for that temperature plunge.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.838" end="00:41:26.878" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a tropical island. Getting</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.758" end="00:41:29.558" style="s2">soaked on a hot day doesn&#39;t make you</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.878" end="00:41:31.918" style="s2">cold. It just cools you off.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.558" end="00:41:33.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe, that&#39;s only because it&#39;s daytime.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.918" end="00:41:34.718" style="s2">Just wait till nightfall.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.118" end="00:41:37.078" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you trying TO PICK A DAMN FIGHT WITH</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.718" end="00:41:37.078" style="s2">ME?</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.518" end="00:41:48.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS IS BAD.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.718" end="00:41:50.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE CAVE SITS too low. It can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.518" end="00:41:52.878" style="s2">withstand a downpour this heavy.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.678" end="00:41:53.998" style="s2">If we stay here, we won&#39;t have anywhere</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.878" end="00:41:56.078" style="s2">left to stand.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.998" end="00:41:57.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what do we do now? Can someone go</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.078" end="00:41:58.758" style="s2">out and get some rocks to block the cave</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.678" end="00:42:00.958" style="s2">entrance?</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.758" end="00:42:03.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We could. But, with the rain coming down</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.958" end="00:42:06.038" style="s2">so hard, who are we supposed to send out</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.318" end="00:42:09.198" style="s2">for rocks?</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.038" end="00:42:12.638" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Footsteps. It&#39;s Lin Yao. It has to be.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.198" end="00:42:12.638" style="s2">He&#39;s come back to save us.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.838" end="00:42:24.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Crocodiles.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.438" end="00:42:27.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are crocodiles.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.998" end="00:42:27.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.318" end="00:42:31.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.318" end="00:42:31.838" style="s2">Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.358" end="00:42:42.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.598" end="00:42:43.278" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve prepared the snake. It&#39;s safe to</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.358" end="00:42:45.198" style="s2">eat.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.278" end="00:42:47.038" style="s2">Besides, snake meat is packed with</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.198" end="00:42:47.478" style="s2">protein. It&#39;s just what we need right</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.038" end="00:42:49.558" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.478" end="00:42:53.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, thanks, Lin Yao. It still freaks me</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.558" end="00:42:53.560" style="s2">out. I&#39;ll stick to the grilled fish.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.960" end="00:43:01.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t eat all this myself. You guys</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.960" end="00:43:04.000" style="s2">can have the rest. Thanks, Lin. From now</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.960" end="00:43:05.800" style="s2">on, whatever you ask us to do, we&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.000" end="00:43:07.600" style="s2">it. WE&#39;D GO THROUGH FIRE AND WATER FOR</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.800" end="00:43:09.840" style="s2">YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.600" end="00:43:11.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, WHY ARE THERE CROCODILES ON THIS</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.840" end="00:43:14.240" style="s2">STUPID ISLAND?</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.720" end="00:43:17.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Jiao, IT&#39;S A TROPICAL ISLAND. OF</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.240" end="00:43:17.760" style="s2">COURSE THERE ARE CROCODILES.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.880" end="00:43:22.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT UP, YOU JINX.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.520" end="00:43:25.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, Lin Yao,</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.320" end="00:43:25.920" style="s2">you cannibal freak.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.240" end="00:43:31.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come any closer.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.920" end="00:43:43.400" style="s2">Don&#39;t eat me. THERE ARE PLENTY MORE</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.200" end="00:43:45.800" style="s2">PEOPLE BACK THERE. I&#39;LL TAKE you to</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.400" end="00:43:45.800" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.160" end="00:44:01.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We lost that crocodile, right?</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.440" end="00:44:05.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do?</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.960" end="00:44:07.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There used to be so many of us in class.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.120" end="00:44:10.480" style="s2">Now it&#39;s just a few of us.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.680" end="00:44:12.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t panic. We just got separated.</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.480" end="00:44:12.920" style="s2">Once the weather clears up, we&#39;ll find</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.240" end="00:44:14.640" style="s2">the others.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.920" end="00:44:16.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all Lin Yao&#39;s fault. That</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.640" end="00:44:18.160" style="s2">selfish jerk just vanished when we</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.200" end="00:44:19.760" style="s2">needed him. He left us in that dangerous</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.160" end="00:44:21.280" style="s2">cave to fend for ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.760" end="00:44:23.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does Lin Yao have to do with this?</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.280" end="00:44:23.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We misunderstood him, and he still gave</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.120" end="00:44:25.680" style="s2">us food.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.840" end="00:44:27.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He even gave us a place to stay. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.680" end="00:44:28.880" style="s2">done more than enough for us.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.000" end="00:44:29.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yanan, I can&#39;t believe you&#39;re taking Lin</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.880" end="00:44:31.400" style="s2">Yao&#39;s side.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.680" end="00:44:32.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bet he knew there&#39;d be a storm today</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.400" end="00:44:34.440" style="s2">and was up to no good when</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.920" end="00:44:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let us have the cave.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.440" end="00:44:38.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, everyone. Calm down. Our</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.880" end="00:44:41.200" style="s2">priority right now is finding somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.600" end="00:44:41.200" style="s2">to shelter.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.400" end="00:44:47.360" style="s2">Look, everyone. This mountain is high,</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.720" end="00:44:49.200" style="s2">so it shouldn&#39;t flood. There&#39;s plenty of</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.360" end="00:44:52.480" style="s2">vegetation up there. We might find a</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.200" end="00:44:52.480" style="s2">cave or somewhere similar.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.041" end="00:45:03.641" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you smell that?</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.961" end="00:45:03.641" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It smells like meat.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.961" end="00:45:09.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something&#39;s not right. Why would there</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.761" end="00:45:10.681" style="s2">be a smell of meat out here in the</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.361" end="00:45:12.761" style="s2">middle of nowhere?</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.681" end="00:45:15.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could it be cannibals?</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.761" end="00:45:16.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, it probably isn&#39;t cannibals. Ling</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.081" end="00:45:20.001" style="s2">Yu scouted ahead for us before, and</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.761" end="00:45:20.001" style="s2">their camp isn&#39;t around here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.041" end="00:45:35.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Panda, Pan Ah, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.681" end="00:45:37.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously, you guys have it pretty good.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.081" end="00:45:39.401" style="s2">You&#39;re hiding out here eating good food.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.161" end="00:45:40.401" style="s2">Share some with us.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.401" end="00:45:43.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP RIGHT THERE.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.401" end="00:45:45.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t belong here. Leave at once.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.161" end="00:45:46.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Panda, Pan Ah, what are you talking</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.121" end="00:45:48.921" style="s2">about? What do you mean we don&#39;t belong</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.721" end="00:45:51.041" style="s2">here? Crocodiles chased us all the way</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.921" end="00:45:51.681" style="s2">here. Let us in so we can catch our</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.041" end="00:45:53.881" style="s2">breath.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.681" end="00:45:55.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Ling is resting inside. Without</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.881" end="00:45:57.001" style="s2">his permission, no one is allowed to set</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.961" end="00:45:57.921" style="s2">foot in this cave.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.001" end="00:45:58.841" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu!</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.921" end="00:46:00.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.841" end="00:46:02.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Panda, Pan Ah, have you lost your minds?</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.921" end="00:46:05.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re actually working for Ling Yu?</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.761" end="00:46:07.681" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling provides our food and shelter. The</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.081" end="00:46:09.961" style="s2">least we can do is work for him.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.681" end="00:46:12.041" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re classmates, so we don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.961" end="00:46:14.241" style="s2">give you a hard time. So, be smart and</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.041" end="00:46:16.401" style="s2">leave. Don&#39;t make this difficult for us.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.241" end="00:46:20.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, I need to talk to Ling Yu. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.401" end="00:46:20.401" style="s2">urgent. Please go tell him I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.121" end="00:46:25.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This island is full of danger. If it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.241" end="00:46:27.161" style="s2">urgent, we can&#39;t afford to waste time.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.401" end="00:46:29.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s the plan, Pan Ah. Stay here and</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.161" end="00:46:31.721" style="s2">keep an eye on them. I&#39;ll go ask Ling</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.161" end="00:46:31.721" style="s2">what to do.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.361" end="00:46:39.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu sure knows how to throw his</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.081" end="00:46:40.041" style="s2">weight around. He really thinks he owns</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.161" end="00:46:41.761" style="s2">this island.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.041" end="00:46:43.881" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Panda and Pan Ah are a couple of</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.761" end="00:46:45.921" style="s2">cowards. We are all classmates, yet</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.881" end="00:46:48.961" style="s2">they&#39;re happy to be Ling Yu&#39;s lackeys.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.921" end="00:46:48.961" style="s2">What a disgrace.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.281" end="00:46:57.682" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear you have something urgent to tell</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.043" end="00:46:59.922" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.682" end="00:47:02.083" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, some of our classmates are in</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.922" end="00:47:03.763" style="s2">trouble. A crocodile attacked us in the</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.083" end="00:47:05.803" style="s2">cave you left behind.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.763" end="00:47:07.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So?</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.803" end="00:47:09.882" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That crocodile was vicious. Zhao Yu and</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.803" end="00:47:12.442" style="s2">the others are missing. There are barely</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.882" end="00:47:13.682" style="s2">any of us left. I think the rest of us</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.442" end="00:47:14.963" style="s2">should stick together.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.682" end="00:47:17.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liu Weiwei,</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.963" end="00:47:18.723" style="s2">have you forgotten something?</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.162" end="00:47:21.402" style="s2">You were the one who suggested kicking</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.723" end="00:47:23.402" style="s2">me out. From that moment on, I stopped</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.402" end="00:47:25.243" style="s2">being one of you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.402" end="00:47:26.362" style="s2">We settled this already. So, don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.243" end="00:47:28.362" style="s2">running to me</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.362" end="00:47:30.362" style="s2">every time you get into trouble. And I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.362" end="00:47:32.642" style="s2">on my lunch break. You interrupted me</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.362" end="00:47:33.843" style="s2">over something this trivial. How are you</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.642" end="00:47:36.283" style="s2">going to make it up to me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.843" end="00:47:39.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, don&#39;t push it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.283" end="00:47:40.882" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I&#39;m being unreasonable? If that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.162" end="00:47:42.483" style="s2">what you think, then I&#39;ll do something</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.882" end="00:47:43.723" style="s2">perfectly reasonable.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.483" end="00:47:45.283" style="s2">Liu Weiwei,</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.723" end="00:47:46.162" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you in, but there&#39;s one</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.283" end="00:47:48.882" style="s2">condition.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.162" end="00:47:50.083" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. If you&#39;ll help us, I&#39;ll agree to</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.882" end="00:47:53.442" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.083" end="00:47:55.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Since you&#39;re so agreeable, then,</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.442" end="00:47:58.043" style="s2">in front of everyone here, take off your</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.523" end="00:47:58.043" style="s2">clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.283" end="00:48:01.882" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, how could you say something</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.083" end="00:48:05.162" style="s2">like that? You&#39;re a monster hiding</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.882" end="00:48:05.162" style="s2">behind a human face.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.323" end="00:48:10.362" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Idiot. Why are you butting in? She&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.763" end="00:48:12.203" style="s2">one taking her clothes off, not you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.362" end="00:48:14.043" style="s2">Think about it. One sacrifice from Liu</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.203" end="00:48:15.602" style="s2">Weiwei and we all get to live in a warm,</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.043" end="00:48:17.723" style="s2">comfortable cave. That&#39;s a pretty good</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.602" end="00:48:20.162" style="s2">deal. And aren&#39;t you curious what the</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.723" end="00:48:23.162" style="s2">class monitor, who&#39;s usually so high and</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.162" end="00:48:24.843" style="s2">mighty, looks like with her clothes off?</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.162" end="00:48:26.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ya Nan, there&#39;s no need to say more.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.843" end="00:48:28.963" style="s2">Ling Yu, I was wrong to blame you</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.442" end="00:48:32.162" style="s2">before. I deserve everything that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.963" end="00:48:34.402" style="s2">happened to me. I accept your terms.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.162" end="00:48:37.523" style="s2">Think of it as my way of making amends.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.402" end="00:48:39.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. I&#39;ve changed my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.523" end="00:48:41.203" style="s2">Since you seem genuinely sorry, I&#39;ll let</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.803" end="00:48:42.682" style="s2">it go for now.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.203" end="00:48:44.882" style="s2">What are you waiting for? You can come</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.682" end="00:48:44.882" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.203" end="00:48:52.362" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, what do you mean BY THAT? YOU</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.122" end="00:48:54.642" style="s2">WENT BACK ON YOUR WORD.</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.362" end="00:48:56.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did I ever go back on my word? I</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.642" end="00:48:58.642" style="s2">only made Liu Weiwei an offer. So,</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.843" end="00:49:03.444" style="s2">naturally, she&#39;s the only one allowed</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.642" end="00:49:03.444" style="s2">in. The rest of you can get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.084" end="00:49:20.564" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, boss. I wasn&#39;t lying. They just</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.364" end="00:49:20.564" style="s2">stepped away for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.204" end="00:49:31.804" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? Why does Liu Wei Wei get to go in</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.004" end="00:49:33.084" style="s2">alone? Liu is obviously letting his lust</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.804" end="00:49:34.844" style="s2">get the better of him. He&#39;s playing</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.084" end="00:49:36.444" style="s2">favorites like crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.844" end="00:49:37.884" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what if she gets in? It&#39;s not like</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.444" end="00:49:39.204" style="s2">she&#39;ll have a great life in there.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.884" end="00:49:41.244" style="s2">She&#39;ll probably be stuck doing the</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.204" end="00:49:42.244" style="s2">dirtiest work like a servant. You all</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.244" end="00:49:43.764" style="s2">need to stop talking.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.244" end="00:49:45.404" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The rain stopped and the floodwater&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.764" end="00:49:47.244" style="s2">starting to recede. The cave we stayed</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.404" end="00:49:50.404" style="s2">in before is low-lying, but we can clean</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.244" end="00:49:50.404" style="s2">it up and make it livable.</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.044" end="00:49:55.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Oh, it&#39;s Zhao. But, Zhao, what</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.524" end="00:49:56.004" style="s2">happened to you? Are you dressed up as a</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.284" end="00:49:58.044" style="s2">zombie?</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.004" end="00:49:59.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, be careful. Something&#39;s wrong</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.044" end="00:50:02.124" style="s2">with Zhao Yu.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.284" end="00:50:04.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, look. I wasn&#39;t lying. They&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.124" end="00:50:04.844" style="s2">right here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.204" end="00:50:12.804" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cannibals. Zhao Yu, you betrayed us.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.204" end="00:50:15.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Screw you. I&#39;m barely surviving as it</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.804" end="00:50:17.124" style="s2">is. How am I supposed to look after you?</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.044" end="00:50:21.549" style="s2">Boss, I brought you the person you</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.124" end="00:50:23.244" style="s2">wanted. Now, can you let ME GO?</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.549" end="00:50:27.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.244" end="00:50:27.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RUN. RUN UP THE MOUNTAIN. HURRY.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.099" end="00:50:30.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.924" end="00:50:35.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BRO, THINGS SEEM QUIET FOR NOW. Why</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.244" end="00:50:36.324" style="s2">don&#39;t we rest against the rock wall for</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.724" end="00:50:36.844" style="s2">a bit?</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.324" end="00:50:38.084" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.844" end="00:50:39.604" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Ling told us to keep watch at</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.084" end="00:50:40.164" style="s2">the cave entrance, so we have to follow</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.604" end="00:50:41.244" style="s2">through.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.164" end="00:50:41.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t let our guard down for a</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.244" end="00:50:42.804" style="s2">second.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.724" end="00:50:44.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to take it that</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.804" end="00:50:45.964" style="s2">seriously. We&#39;re in the middle of</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.284" end="00:50:48.204" style="s2">nowhere. Who&#39;s going to come out here</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.964" end="00:50:50.164" style="s2">besides us? Little bro, do you think</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.204" end="00:50:51.484" style="s2">that rescue team Zhao Yu mentioned will</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.164" end="00:50:52.804" style="s2">ever find us?</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.484" end="00:50:54.604" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows?</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.804" end="00:50:56.444" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t seen a single boat in days.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.604" end="00:50:58.444" style="s2">That tells you everything. No one knows</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.444" end="00:51:00.404" style="s2">when the rescue team will show up. If we</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.444" end="00:51:01.764" style="s2">just keep waiting around, we&#39;ll starve</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.404" end="00:51:03.085" style="s2">to death on this island.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.764" end="00:51:04.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Little bro,</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.085" end="00:51:06.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When Liu Weiwei let everyone in kicking</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.405" end="00:51:07.765" style="s2">Liu Yao out, we went along with it</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.245" end="00:51:09.085" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and ended up offending him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.765" end="00:51:10.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But brother Lin is letting bygones be</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.085" end="00:51:11.805" style="s2">bygones. He&#39;s even sharing food and</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.965" end="00:51:13.725" style="s2">water with us.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.805" end="00:51:16.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have to make the most of this chance.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.725" end="00:51:16.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.845" end="00:51:22.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t we just drive them off? Why are</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.525" end="00:51:22.125" style="s2">those pests back again?</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.445" end="00:51:30.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, why did you bring Liu Weiwei in</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.645" end="00:51:32.005" style="s2">here, too?</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.525" end="00:51:34.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was the one who let the others in</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.005" end="00:51:36.085" style="s2">kicking you out.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.605" end="00:51:38.285" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, what?</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.085" end="00:51:40.205" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with that? Xiao Lan, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.285" end="00:51:43.085" style="s2">you&#39;re not even my girl yet, and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.205" end="00:51:45.885" style="s2">already getting jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.085" end="00:51:46.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BROTHER LIN, THIS IS BAD. THE CANNIBALS</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.885" end="00:51:49.805" style="s2">ARE HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.645" end="00:51:49.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, let&#39;s go see.</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.965" end="00:51:59.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bastards! Just because I WOULDN&#39;T</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.165" end="00:52:01.605" style="s2">LET YOU STAY IN THE CAVE.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.605" end="00:52:04.285" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU ACTUALLY LED THE CANNIBALS HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.605" end="00:52:05.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, NOT US. TAO YU&#39;S THE IDIOT WHO LED</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.285" end="00:52:07.645" style="s2">THE CANNIBALS HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.605" end="00:52:09.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On this island, our only chance of</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.645" end="00:52:13.005" style="s2">survival is sticking with Lin Yao. So,</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.765" end="00:52:13.005" style="s2">we have to prove our worth.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.725" end="00:52:19.885" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME ON, I&#39;LL TAKE YOU ALL ON.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.565" end="00:52:49.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE YOU ALL STANDING AROUND FOR?</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.165" end="00:52:51.685" style="s2">Get in there and help.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.365" end="00:52:54.485" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Look at Pan Rui. Are you guys</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.685" end="00:52:54.485" style="s2">even men?</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.645" end="00:52:59.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help with what? YOU GIRLS ARE YELLING SO</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.925" end="00:53:02.285" style="s2">LOUD. WHY DON&#39;T YOU GET IN THERE AND</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.765" end="00:53:02.285" style="s2">HELP?</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.767" end="00:53:16.487" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEO, watch out.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.927" end="00:53:35.247" style="s2">Hey, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.767" end="00:53:38.487" style="s2">I&#39;m fine, bro. I just didn&#39;t know Lynn</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.247" end="00:53:38.487" style="s2">could fight like that.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.327" end="00:53:43.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.967" end="00:53:51.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s he doing?</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.767" end="00:53:54.607" style="s2">Who knows?</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.007" end="00:53:56.887" style="s2">These primitive people are all out of</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.607" end="00:53:59.527" style="s2">their minds. If I&#39;d had a decent weapon,</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.887" end="00:54:03.967" style="s2">I could have taken them on, too.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.527" end="00:54:06.367" style="s2">Easy to say after the fact. Look.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.967" end="00:54:07.607" style="s2">What the hell? Did this guy mutate or</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.367" end="00:54:09.327" style="s2">something?</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.607" end="00:54:11.287" style="s2">This island really is full of strange</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.327" end="00:54:12.727" style="s2">things, like that bright red fruit from</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.287" end="00:54:14.047" style="s2">earlier. It&#39;s more potent than the</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.727" end="00:54:16.447" style="s2">strongest performance-enhancing drugs</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.047" end="00:54:16.447" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.127" end="00:54:27.607" style="s2">Here.</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.447" end="00:54:28.807" style="s2">Now you&#39;ve got a decent weapon.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.607" end="00:54:29.647" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you just saying you could handle</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.807" end="00:54:32.487" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.647" end="00:54:33.447" style="s2">Then you can take it from here.</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.487" end="00:54:36.207" style="s2">Leo.</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.447" end="00:54:38.327" style="s2">No, Lee. Don&#39;t mess with me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.207" end="00:54:40.487" style="s2">What happened? You were so tough a</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.327" end="00:54:43.287" style="s2">minute ago. Now&#39;s your chance, but</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.487" end="00:54:43.287" style="s2">you&#39;re useless.</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.287" end="00:54:48.927" style="s2">Don&#39;t kill me. Please, don&#39;t kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.767" end="00:54:57.847" style="s2">What&#39;s going on? The savage isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.767" end="00:55:00.327" style="s2">killing me. What an uncivilized</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.847" end="00:55:02.247" style="s2">primitive. That savage may be strong,</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.327" end="00:55:05.247" style="s2">but he doesn&#39;t even have a weapon now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.247" end="00:55:07.688" style="s2">And he still dares mock me. Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.247" end="00:55:10.248" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you pay for that arrogance.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.688" end="00:55:10.248" style="s2">Die.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.613" end="00:55:19.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.408" end="00:55:31.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do? How did he suddenly get</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.608" end="00:55:33.048" style="s2">so strong? Even a wooden spear can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.168" end="00:55:34.208" style="s2">pierce him. He&#39;s practically</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.048" end="00:55:35.648" style="s2">invulnerable.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.208" end="00:55:37.288" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Invulnerable?</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.648" end="00:55:39.728" style="s2">You&#39;re giving him too much credit.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.288" end="00:55:40.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao, why aren&#39;t you even carrying a</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.728" end="00:55:44.208" style="s2">weapon?</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.408" end="00:55:44.208" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to make things complicated.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.328" end="00:55:51.568" style="s2">Even the strongest creatures have a</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.408" end="00:55:51.568" style="s2">fatal weakness.</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.528" end="00:56:10.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wu Shuo, you got free. Come help untie</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.008" end="00:56:12.928" style="s2">me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.728" end="00:56:15.368" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Jao. Isn&#39;t it a bit much to leave</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.928" end="00:56:18.368" style="s2">the cannibals to the others?</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.368" end="00:56:19.808" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TOO FAR, MY ASS. IF I HADN&#39;T DONE IT,</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.368" end="00:56:21.488" style="s2">WE&#39;D BE THE ones tied up and fed to</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.808" end="00:56:22.928" style="s2">those savages.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.488" end="00:56:25.048" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t forget</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.928" end="00:56:26.808" style="s2">I saved your life.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.048" end="00:56:29.248" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t been smart enough to keep</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.808" end="00:56:31.168" style="s2">them busy while they searched, those two</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.248" end="00:56:31.608" style="s2">savages would have torn you limb from</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.168" end="00:56:33.528" style="s2">limb.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.608" end="00:56:35.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, you&#39;re right, Jao. I wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.528" end="00:56:37.888" style="s2">thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.328" end="00:56:39.848" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those cannibals are brutal. The others</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.888" end="00:56:41.608" style="s2">on the mountain are probably done for.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.848" end="00:56:43.408" style="s2">Once they&#39;re all dead, who&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.608" end="00:56:46.088" style="s2">know we did it? When the rescue team</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.408" end="00:56:47.488" style="s2">gets here, I&#39;ll go home in style, just</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.088" end="00:56:49.728" style="s2">like nothing happened.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.488" end="00:56:52.208" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who did you just say was probably done</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.728" end="00:56:52.208" style="s2">for?</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.728" end="00:56:58.088" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.288" end="00:56:59.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.088" end="00:57:02.288" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jao Yu.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.128" end="00:57:06.808" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bastard. You let the cannibals right</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.288" end="00:57:06.808" style="s2">to us. You almost GOT US KILLED.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.888" end="00:57:09.848" style="s2">SCREW YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.248" end="00:57:15.089" style="s2">WHO THE HELL DO YOU THINK YOU ARE? WHAT</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.569" end="00:57:19.169" style="s2">GIVES YOU THE RIGHT TO QUESTION ME?</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.089" end="00:57:19.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t get to ask. What about me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.289" end="00:57:29.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liu Wei Wei, you you and Lin Yu are</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.969" end="00:57:29.049" style="s2">together NOW, TOO.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.289" end="00:57:33.449" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE WHAT? GOT A PROBLEM WITH THAT?</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.449" end="00:57:39.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a misunderstanding. Lin Yu, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.889" end="00:57:40.889" style="s2">all a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.249" end="00:57:43.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Yu, what happened to the watch you</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.889" end="00:57:45.044" style="s2">used to contact the rescue team?</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.024" end="00:57:45.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.769" end="00:57:50.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s gone. It&#39;s really gone.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.089" end="00:57:51.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the heck? If the watch is gone, how</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.249" end="00:57:53.129" style="s2">will the rescue team ever find us?</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.649" end="00:57:55.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you all yelling about? WHO SAYS</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.129" end="00:57:56.209" style="s2">THE WATCH IS LOST? IT PROBABLY JUST FELL</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.049" end="00:57:58.209" style="s2">SOMEWHERE ALONG the way.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.209" end="00:57:59.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget the watch for now, Zhao Yu. I</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.209" end="00:58:01.569" style="s2">want to settle the score with you over</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.529" end="00:58:03.129" style="s2">those cannibals first.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.569" end="00:58:05.009" style="s2">You all seem fine, so those two</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.129" end="00:58:06.449" style="s2">cannibals must not have found you. Why</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.009" end="00:58:07.769" style="s2">don&#39;t we just let it go?</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.449" end="00:58:09.969" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:58:07.769" end="00:58:11.809" style="s2">YOU CALL THIS FINE? IF BROTHER Lin</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.969" end="00:58:14.369" style="s2">hadn&#39;t stepped in, we&#39;d all be dead</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.809" end="00:58:14.369" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.169" end="00:58:20.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wha- what are you saying?</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.249" end="00:58:21.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu took down both cannibals on his</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.249" end="00:58:24.529" style="s2">own.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.929" end="00:58:25.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And they were mutated cannibals, too.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.529" end="00:58:27.129" style="s2">Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.649" end="00:58:28.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even the cannibals couldn&#39;t take him</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.129" end="00:58:31.569" style="s2">out. How&#39;d this kid get even tougher</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.609" end="00:58:33.409" style="s2">than Corvega?</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.569" end="00:58:36.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I WARNED YOU. WE&#39;RE LIVING IN A</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.409" end="00:58:38.249" style="s2">SOCIETY GOVERNED BY LAW.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.649" end="00:58:39.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M FREEZING.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.249" end="00:58:42.329" style="s2">It&#39;s so cold.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.849" end="00:58:43.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least we still have a fire.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.329" end="00:58:45.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu&#39;s got some nerve. We helped her</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.929" end="00:58:47.329" style="s2">deal with Zhao Yu, and all we got was a</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.849" end="00:58:48.809" style="s2">little firewood. Dude wouldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.329" end="00:58:50.849" style="s2">spare us any food or water.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.809" end="00:58:52.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. I&#39;ve never seen anyone so</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.849" end="00:58:54.209" style="s2">stingy in my life.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.209" end="00:58:56.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say that. If Lin Yu hadn&#39;t shared</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.209" end="00:58:57.929" style="s2">those dry branches with us, we wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.369" end="00:58:59.569" style="s2">even have a fire right now.</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.929" end="00:59:01.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? Even this little bit of</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.569" end="00:59:02.289" style="s2">firewood only came because Yan had to</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.369" end="00:59:04.369" style="s2">beg for it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.289" end="00:59:05.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bet Lin Yu never wanted to give us any</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.369" end="00:59:07.449" style="s2">in the first place.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.609" end="00:59:08.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Helping is a kindness, not an</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.449" end="00:59:11.249" style="s2">obligation.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.409" end="00:59:12.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it a rest, you two.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.249" end="00:59:14.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao,</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.369" end="00:59:17.851" style="s2">our classmates kicked us out.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.571" end="00:59:19.611" style="s2">Are we really sleeping out here tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.851" end="00:59:22.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hu Che.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.611" end="00:59:24.211" style="s2">All these years, you&#39;ve never even been</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.571" end="00:59:27.611" style="s2">with a woman, have you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.211" end="00:59:31.211" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao. Why are you asking?</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.611" end="00:59:32.691" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve already come this far.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.211" end="00:59:34.771" style="s2">Tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.691" end="00:59:37.611" style="s2">I&#39;ll let you have a taste of those</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.771" end="00:59:37.611" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:59:46.171" end="00:59:48.491" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.411" end="00:59:56.291" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.811" end="01:00:00.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Yu, ARE YOU CRAZY?</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.531" end="01:00:01.371" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STAY BACK,</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.231" end="01:00:02.811" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.371" end="01:00:05.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OR I&#39;LL STRANGLE HIM.</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.811" end="01:00:07.291" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, ZHAO. EASY. LET&#39;S TALK this out.</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.571" end="01:00:08.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Zhao Yu. We&#39;re all classmates.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.291" end="01:00:10.531" style="s2">Whatever it is, we can talk.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.731" end="01:00:11.091" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s talk it out. Don&#39;t do anything</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.531" end="01:00:12.651" style="s2">rash.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.091" end="01:00:14.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To hell WITH BEING CLASSMATES. WE&#39;RE</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.651" end="01:00:16.651" style="s2">STRANDED ON AN ISLAND. CLASSMATES MEAN</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.571" end="01:00:18.611" style="s2">NOTHING HERE. IT&#39;S MEN VERSUS WOMEN.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.651" end="01:00:19.371" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ZHAO YU, you can&#39;t do this. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.611" end="01:00:21.331" style="s2">illegal.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.371" end="01:00:23.291" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Illegal? Then let me make this clear. WE</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.331" end="01:00:25.371" style="s2">CAN&#39;T FIND THE WATCH. NONE OF US ARE</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.291" end="01:00:27.291" style="s2">EVER GETTING THE HELL OFF THIS ISLAND.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.371" end="01:00:29.011" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE&#39;RE NEVER GOING BACK ANYWAY.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.291" end="01:00:31.771" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll kill HIM RIGHT IN FRONT OF YOU</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.011" end="01:00:31.771" style="s2">ALL TONIGHT.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.771" end="01:00:39.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE RESCUE TEAM isn&#39;t coming. We really</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.411" end="01:00:41.251" style="s2">aren&#39;t getting home.</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.411" end="01:00:43.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hu Che. Take about the toilet.</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.251" end="01:00:44.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you really just going to stand by</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.171" end="01:00:46.331" style="s2">and watch?</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.171" end="01:00:49.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hu Che. You&#39;d better think about what</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.331" end="01:00:49.931" style="s2">happens if you cross me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.047" end="01:00:52.051" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.931" end="01:00:55.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I finally figured it out.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.051" end="01:00:57.371" style="s2">On this island, only men deserve a say.</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.251" end="01:00:59.211" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re willing, you can take your</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.371" end="01:01:02.891" style="s2">pick of these women.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.211" end="01:01:02.891" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish Ling Yu were here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.091" end="01:01:08.331" style="s2">Please, don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.651" end="01:01:14.371" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.771" end="01:01:20.011" style="s2">I said, &quot;Stop.&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.052" end="01:01:44.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, An Yue, where are you?</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.687" end="01:01:48.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.812" end="01:01:53.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, is that you?</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.062" end="01:02:05.082" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.692" end="01:02:08.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.972" end="01:02:13.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.172" end="01:02:17.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, I just had a nightmare. It was</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.972" end="01:02:19.612" style="s2">terrifying. Absolutely terrifying.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.612" end="01:02:23.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear all that?</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.612" end="01:02:25.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Loud and clear, Lin. I&#39;ll get it done.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.492" end="01:02:28.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, I thought I heard you telling</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.772" end="01:02:29.972" style="s2">them to hide the bodies. I I wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.012" end="01:02:30.652" style="s2">trying to eavesdrop. I just came out for</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.972" end="01:02:32.292" style="s2">some air.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.652" end="01:02:34.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard right. Those two cannibals</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.292" end="01:02:35.532" style="s2">died yesterday. I asked Panda and Parr</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.452" end="01:02:36.612" style="s2">to find a place to preserve their</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.532" end="01:02:39.052" style="s2">bodies.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.612" end="01:02:40.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why keep them? Wouldn&#39;t it be easier to</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.052" end="01:02:42.612" style="s2">burn them or throw them into the sea?</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.892" end="01:02:44.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because Xia Wan Ning dreamed last night</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.612" end="01:02:46.572" style="s2">that I died. So, to keep that from</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.452" end="01:02:49.172" style="s2">happening, I need to take a few extra</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.572" end="01:02:52.412" style="s2">precautions. It&#39;s a nice day. Come take</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.172" end="01:02:52.412" style="s2">a walk on the beach with me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.452" end="01:03:02.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, don&#39;t overthink it. That giant</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.092" end="01:03:04.132" style="s2">10-m snake was just a dream.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.012" end="01:03:06.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know it was a dream, but I had that</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.132" end="01:03:08.372" style="s2">nightmare three times last night. And</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.532" end="01:03:10.012" style="s2">Ling Yu showed me there really are</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.372" end="01:03:10.492" style="s2">creatures like the titan python on this</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.012" end="01:03:12.412" style="s2">island.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.492" end="01:03:13.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Even if you&#39;re right, that doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.412" end="01:03:15.572" style="s2">prove the dream will come true. Just</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.892" end="01:03:17.092" style="s2">because it happens in a dream doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.572" end="01:03:19.213" style="s2">mean it&#39;ll happen in real life. But</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.092" end="01:03:22.653" style="s2">there is another possibility.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.213" end="01:03:24.693" style="s2">You might be able to see the future.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.653" end="01:03:28.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it. WHO THE HELL TIED ME UP IN A</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.693" end="01:03:28.373" style="s2">TREE? UNTIE ME ALREADY.</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.533" end="01:03:31.573" style="s2">DUH, YOU BLIND IDIOT. GET OVER HERE AND</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.853" end="01:03:33.653" style="s2">UNTIE ME.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.573" end="01:03:34.853" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DUH, YOU YOU GOD DAMN ANIMAL. FIRST YOU</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.653" end="01:03:36.133" style="s2">MISTREAT YOUR FRIENDS, THEN you harass</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.853" end="01:03:37.453" style="s2">the girls in our class, and now you</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.133" end="01:03:39.613" style="s2">still have the nerve to yell at us.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.453" end="01:03:42.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey brother Jaw, it&#39;s not that I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.613" end="01:03:44.053" style="s2">help you. No one listens to me now.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.053" end="01:03:45.853" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean, no one listens to you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.053" end="01:03:47.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll admit I was in the wrong yesterday,</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.853" end="01:03:49.813" style="s2">but you left me hanging all night. That</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.573" end="01:03:51.053" style="s2">makes us even, right? Besides, there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.813" end="01:03:51.813" style="s2">something I haven&#39;t told you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.053" end="01:03:53.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.813" end="01:03:55.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zuo Yu, you&#39;re just trying to trick us</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.533" end="01:03:55.653" style="s2">into untying you so you can make a run</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.213" end="01:03:57.533" style="s2">for it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.653" end="01:03:59.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Believe it or don&#39;t. I don&#39;t know what</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.533" end="01:04:00.493" style="s2">kind of trick that woman pulled last</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.133" end="01:04:02.173" style="s2">night though. But if you want to spend</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.493" end="01:04:04.573" style="s2">the rest of your lives under a bunch of</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.173" end="01:04:05.573" style="s2">women&#39;s thumbs, then keep stringing me</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.573" end="01:04:08.053" style="s2">along.</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.573" end="01:04:10.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So your secret can make us stronger.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.053" end="01:04:12.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stronger is putting it mildly. We could</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.053" end="01:04:15.373" style="s2">even take down Lin Yu, who&#39;s hogging the</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.333" end="01:04:15.373" style="s2">cave and the women.</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.973" end="01:04:27.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ya Nan, you were amazing yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.333" end="01:04:28.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, Ya Nan. If you hadn&#39;t stepped in</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.133" end="01:04:30.733" style="s2">last night, that animal Jaw Yu would</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.973" end="01:04:32.333" style="s2">have had his way with me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.733" end="01:04:33.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still don&#39;t understand what happened</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.333" end="01:04:34.493" style="s2">last night.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.013" end="01:04:36.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s not to understand? It was a</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.493" end="01:04:37.613" style="s2">superpower. Ya Nan, you&#39;ve awakened a</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.533" end="01:04:39.853" style="s2">superpower.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.613" end="01:04:41.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A superpower? How is that possible?</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.853" end="01:04:43.413" style="s2">Aren&#39;t those just in novels?</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.213" end="01:04:44.893" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, it was definitely a superpower.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.413" end="01:04:46.453" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t believe it either, but we all</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.893" end="01:04:47.693" style="s2">saw it with our own eyes last night.</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.453" end="01:04:48.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could we have imagined it? Isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.693" end="01:04:49.933" style="s2">that right, Xiao Ran?</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.613" end="01:04:51.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was it a superpower?</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.933" end="01:04:53.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why don&#39;t we have Ya Nan show us again?</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.933" end="01:04:54.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could, but</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.053" end="01:04:55.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I remember. Ya Nan used her power</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.813" end="01:04:57.493" style="s2">last night, then</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.773" end="01:04:59.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; passed out for the whole night.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.493" end="01:05:02.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you think it could have side effects?</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.773" end="01:05:02.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it has side effects, let&#39;s not risk</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.053" end="01:05:03.893" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.373" end="01:05:05.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that we have a superpower,</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.893" end="01:05:07.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; could we go negotiate with Lin Yu?</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.533" end="01:05:09.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Ya Nan&#39;s so powerful now. Lin</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.773" end="01:05:11.613" style="s2">Yu will definitely give us food and</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.213" end="01:05:11.613" style="s2">water.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.413" end="01:05:24.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yu, I found these two stools on the</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.455" end="01:05:25.855" style="s2">shore. They should be fine once they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.055" end="01:05:27.415" style="s2">cleaned. Leo, do you really believe</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.855" end="01:05:28.935" style="s2">Xiawaning&#39;s dream from last night?</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.415" end="01:05:30.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One dream could be a coincidence, but</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.935" end="01:05:30.895" style="s2">what about three identical dreams in a</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.375" end="01:05:32.095" style="s2">row?</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.895" end="01:05:32.815" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you think it&#39;s an omen?</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.095" end="01:05:34.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.815" end="01:05:36.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I was a kid, the night before my</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.375" end="01:05:37.775" style="s2">grandma died, I did have a bad feeling</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.535" end="01:05:39.255" style="s2">something was going to happen.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.775" end="01:05:41.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But, Xiawaning&#39;s situation seems</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.255" end="01:05:42.655" style="s2">different. She remembers every detail of</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.615" end="01:05:43.895" style="s2">the dream.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.655" end="01:05:45.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cannibals,</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.895" end="01:05:48.095" style="s2">a titan python, and a rescue team that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.975" end="01:05:49.895" style="s2">gone missing. Everything on this island</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.095" end="01:05:51.575" style="s2">is out of the ordinary. It&#39;s probably</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.895" end="01:05:53.455" style="s2">caused by disturbances in the magnetic</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.575" end="01:05:55.735" style="s2">field. In a place like this, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.455" end="01:05:57.655" style="s2">possible for ordinary people to mutate</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.735" end="01:05:59.655" style="s2">after coming here. Maybe my desert</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.655" end="01:06:02.775" style="s2">island fishing system is a unique kind</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.655" end="01:06:02.775" style="s2">of mutation, too.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.735" end="01:06:11.415" style="s2">This fish is putting up an even stronger</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.615" end="01:06:13.895" style="s2">fight than that grouper I caught on day</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.415" end="01:06:13.895" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.575" end="01:06:26.855" style="s2">So, how is it? Exciting, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.335" end="01:06:32.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding. Congrats, host. You caught a</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.135" end="01:06:34.055" style="s2">changi fish. Ding. New fish added to the</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.135" end="01:06:35.215" style="s2">collection. Ancient spear thorn. Ding.</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.055" end="01:06:36.935" style="s2">You&#39;ve earned the ancient spear thorn</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.215" end="01:06:38.135" style="s2">collection reward. Absolute defense.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.935" end="01:06:39.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolute defense.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.135" end="01:06:40.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The host can survive up to three</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.255" end="01:06:42.495" style="s2">life-threatening situations per day. The</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.895" end="01:06:43.335" style="s2">counter resets every day.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.495" end="01:06:45.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.335" end="01:06:46.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Host collection has reached 10 fish.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.175" end="01:06:47.615" style="s2">Congrats, host. You&#39;ve earned an</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.335" end="01:06:49.295" style="s2">advanced fishing rod and ultimate</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.615" end="01:06:49.895" style="s2">fishing mastery twice. You can now catch</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.295" end="01:06:50.935" style="s2">any fish.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.895" end="01:06:52.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first time you catch a new species,</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.935" end="01:06:53.775" style="s2">you&#39;ll earn a collection reward. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.135" end="01:06:55.375" style="s2">also likely reel in fresh water, food,</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.775" end="01:06:57.255" style="s2">tools, building materials, medicine, and</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.375" end="01:06:58.615" style="s2">other survival supplies.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.255" end="01:07:00.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like I&#39;ll need to keep combing the</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.615" end="01:07:02.175" style="s2">shore over the next few days.</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.295" end="01:07:02.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, that fish looks weird. Is it</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.175" end="01:07:04.815" style="s2">poisonous?</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.775" end="01:07:06.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a coelacanth, an ancient fish that</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.815" end="01:07:07.775" style="s2">dates back some 66 million years. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.735" end="01:07:09.815" style="s2">genuine living fossil.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.775" end="01:07:11.815" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 66 million years ago? That&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.815" end="01:07:13.215" style="s2">Cretaceous, isn&#39;t it? This fish lived</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.815" end="01:07:15.215" style="s2">alongside the dinosaurs.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.215" end="01:07:15.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, look at you. You know a thing or</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.215" end="01:07:17.215" style="s2">two.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.895" end="01:07:19.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just happened to read a few books</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.215" end="01:07:19.655" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.576" end="01:07:31.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Yu</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.816" end="01:07:31.136" style="s2">Mhm?</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.976" end="01:07:36.536" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.736" end="01:07:38.376" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the secret to getting stronger</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.536" end="01:07:40.616" style="s2">you mentioned?</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.376" end="01:07:44.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush? Just follow me and quit</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.616" end="01:07:44.536" style="s2">worrying. You think I&#39;d lie to you?</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.736" end="01:07:59.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is what an increased drop rate</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.576" end="01:08:02.096" style="s2">feels like. Not only are the fish biting</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.656" end="01:08:03.656" style="s2">more, but I&#39;m reeling them in faster.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.096" end="01:08:07.056" style="s2">I&#39;m getting tons of all kinds of</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.656" end="01:08:07.056" style="s2">survival supplies, too.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.456" end="01:08:17.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.336" end="01:08:17.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao, we&#39;re here to work with you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.496" end="01:08:28.656" style="s2">Burke, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.896" end="01:08:30.296" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should be asking you that. Who do you</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.656" end="01:08:31.856" style="s2">think you are touching Brother Lin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.296" end="01:08:34.576" style="s2">things? I</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.856" end="01:08:36.976" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Yana&#39;s friend. He has superpowers</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.576" end="01:08:39.416" style="s2">now. He&#39;s really powerful, you know?</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.976" end="01:08:40.776" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re crazy.</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.416" end="01:08:43.096" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can tell you&#39;ve never seen much of</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.776" end="01:08:45.136" style="s2">the world.</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.096" end="01:08:47.856" style="s2">Lin Yao, I want to work with you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.136" end="01:08:49.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really have superpowers?</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.856" end="01:08:51.496" style="s2">If he&#39;s telling the truth, then</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.416" end="01:08:53.856" style="s2">Shaoneng&#39;s prophetic dreams could be a</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.496" end="01:08:55.896" style="s2">kind of superpower, too.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.856" end="01:08:58.016" style="s2">All right. I&#39;ll work with you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.896" end="01:09:00.976" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao, you really agreed. Aren&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.016" end="01:09:02.456" style="s2">going to ask what Yana&#39;s ability is?</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.976" end="01:09:04.976" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.456" end="01:09:06.416" style="s2">I don&#39;t care. I couldn&#39;t care less about</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.976" end="01:09:08.056" style="s2">superpowers.</p>
<p begin="01:09:06.416" end="01:09:10.416" style="s2">I just hope you&#39;ll be of some use when I</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.056" end="01:09:12.376" style="s2">need you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.416" end="01:09:14.056" style="s2">As for what I promised you, I&#39;ll set</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.376" end="01:09:16.256" style="s2">aside part of the cave for you to sleep</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.056" end="01:09:17.856" style="s2">in. As for water and food, you&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.256" end="01:09:18.296" style="s2">only the bare minimum to survive each</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.856" end="01:09:20.496" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.296" end="01:09:21.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bare minimum? So, we&#39;ll barely get</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.496" end="01:09:23.896" style="s2">enough to keep from starving.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.896" end="01:09:25.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yao, we came to you in good faith.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.896" end="01:09:27.538" style="s2">Is this how you treat us?</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.176" end="01:09:29.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, you&#39;re living it up now. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.538" end="01:09:32.058" style="s2">wrong with giving us a little more?</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.737" end="01:09:33.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want better treatment. Fine, but you</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.058" end="01:09:35.177" style="s2">can&#39;t just talk your way into it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.777" end="01:09:37.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we have to do?</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.177" end="01:09:38.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are plenty of ways. You can work</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.137" end="01:09:41.018" style="s2">for me. You can go down the mountain and</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.938" end="01:09:43.458" style="s2">gather firewood for me. You can even use</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.018" end="01:09:45.257" style="s2">your feminine wiles to please me. But</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.458" end="01:09:48.177" style="s2">that&#39;s for later. For now, I&#39;ve laid out</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.257" end="01:09:49.697" style="s2">my terms. Whether you stay is up to you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.177" end="01:09:51.177" style="s2">It&#39;s not my problem, but I should warn</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.697" end="01:09:53.297" style="s2">you that cave at the foot of the</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.177" end="01:09:55.698" style="s2">mountain is at low elevation. If a real</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.297" end="01:09:56.938" style="s2">storm or tsunami hits, it won&#39;t hold up.</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.698" end="01:09:58.778" style="s2">And that&#39;s not even counting the</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.938" end="01:10:01.378" style="s2">cannibals and dangerous beasts.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.778" end="01:10:05.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yao, are you threatening us?</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.378" end="01:10:05.218" style="s2">Ling Yao, I accept your terms.</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.388" end="01:10:13.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.018" end="01:10:15.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t walk another step.</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.657" end="01:10:16.778" style="s2">How much farther do we have to go? I</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.378" end="01:10:17.258" style="s2">feel like I&#39;m about to dehydrate in this</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.778" end="01:10:18.978" style="s2">heat.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.258" end="01:10:22.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s all the whining about? You think</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.978" end="01:10:24.058" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE TIRED? YOU THINK I&#39;M NOT?</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.218" end="01:10:28.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I COULD HAVE SWORN IT WAS AROUND HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.058" end="01:10:28.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE IT IS. I FOUND IT.</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.058" end="01:10:33.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT IS IT?</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.818" end="01:10:35.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; JIAO, IS THIS THE secret you mentioned?</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.898" end="01:10:37.778" style="s2">These fruits are tiny and sour. They</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.818" end="01:10:40.938" style="s2">won&#39;t fill us up at all. Isn&#39;t this what</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.778" end="01:10:42.378" style="s2">those cannibals were eating?</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.938" end="01:10:43.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.378" end="01:10:45.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t expect you to know what you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.458" end="01:10:46.458" style="s2">looking at. That&#39;s right. These aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.418" end="01:10:47.978" style="s2">ordinary fruits.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.458" end="01:10:50.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw those two savages eat these</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.978" end="01:10:51.938" style="s2">earlier. Even crocodiles steer clear of</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.097" end="01:10:52.858" style="s2">them. They&#39;re insanely strong.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.938" end="01:10:54.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what are we waiting for?</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.858" end="01:10:55.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With these, we can get all the supplies</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.298" end="01:10:58.657" style="s2">Ling Yao has. Then we can take as much</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.938" end="01:10:58.657" style="s2">as we want.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.018" end="01:11:02.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hu Che, why are you stopping us?</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.858" end="01:11:03.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, even if we can&#39;t take on Ling Yao</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.458" end="01:11:04.898" style="s2">right now, these fruits should at least</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.978" end="01:11:06.698" style="s2">quench our thirst.</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.898" end="01:11:08.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hu Che, I&#39;ve known something was off</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.698" end="01:11:09.738" style="s2">about you for a while. Are you Ling</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.258" end="01:11:11.018" style="s2">Yao&#39;s spy or what?</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.738" end="01:11:12.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could I be?</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.018" end="01:11:13.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Jiao, we really can&#39;t eat these</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.657" end="01:11:13.858" style="s2">fruits.</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.258" end="01:11:15.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.858" end="01:11:17.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These fruits just aren&#39;t normal. I think</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.818" end="01:11:17.938" style="s2">eating them could have serious side</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.097" end="01:11:19.177" style="s2">effects.</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.938" end="01:11:19.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the cannibals seemed fine after</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.177" end="01:11:20.858" style="s2">eating them.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.738" end="01:11:22.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s because they grew up on this</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.858" end="01:11:24.978" style="s2">island. Their genes and immune systems</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.738" end="01:11:26.458" style="s2">are way stronger than ours.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.978" end="01:11:28.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t make an omelet without</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.458" end="01:11:30.219" style="s2">breaking a few eggs.</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.058" end="01:11:32.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going through with this, no matter</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.219" end="01:11:32.819" style="s2">what.</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.139" end="01:11:50.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yue, what are we making this for?</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.979" end="01:11:52.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So we can go out and fish.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.019" end="01:11:54.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who have we you? Can&#39;t we catch fish</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.419" end="01:11:56.939" style="s2">right here on the shore?</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.619" end="01:12:01.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, we can.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.939" end="01:12:01.219" style="s2">But rougher seas mean bigger catches.</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.139" end="01:12:06.339" style="s2">Now that we have more tents, we don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.659" end="01:12:08.859" style="s2">have to cram so many people together to</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.339" end="01:12:08.859" style="s2">sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.019" end="01:12:16.819" style="s2">Liu Weiwei, how was your day?</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.099" end="01:12:19.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty good.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.819" end="01:12:22.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Glad to hear it. Remember that</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.299" end="01:12:24.019" style="s2">favor you owed me and how you used me as</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.099" end="01:12:24.939" style="s2">a shield in front of Zhao Yue.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.019" end="01:12:26.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yue.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.939" end="01:12:30.179" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.619" end="01:12:30.179" style="s2">Come keep me company tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.619" end="01:12:42.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why aren&#39;t you asleep?</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.499" end="01:12:47.899" style="s2">An Yue.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.739" end="01:12:49.779" style="s2">What do you think Lin Yue and Liu Weiwei</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.899" end="01:12:52.859" style="s2">are doing in that tent?</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.779" end="01:12:54.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just sleeping, probably. Or</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.859" end="01:12:58.619" style="s2">I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.219" end="01:12:58.619" style="s2">Stop overthinking it. Get some sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.419" end="01:13:04.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin Yue. Could you stop making those</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.419" end="01:13:07.899" style="s2">weird noises?</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.859" end="01:13:10.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, I can&#39;t help it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.899" end="01:13:11.859" style="s2">Your massage feels way too good.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.659" end="01:13:13.739" style="s2">Liu Weiwei.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.859" end="01:13:17.419" style="s2">Can you promise you won&#39;t make those</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.739" end="01:13:19.859" style="s2">noises when it feels good?</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.419" end="01:13:22.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Zhao. How much longer do we have to</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.859" end="01:13:24.419" style="s2">wait? I&#39;m freezing my ass off here.</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.339" end="01:13:26.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would you know? That Lin Yue guy is</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.419" end="01:13:28.659" style="s2">seriously dangerous. We may have a</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.379" end="01:13:30.460" style="s2">secret weapon, but but he took down the</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.659" end="01:13:32.820" style="s2">cannibals before, so we need to be</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.460" end="01:13:36.500" style="s2">careful. Let&#39;s wait until they&#39;re fast</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.820" end="01:13:36.500" style="s2">asleep before we make a move.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.740" end="01:13:40.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you&#39;re a idiot to begin</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.420" end="01:13:40.781" style="s2">with.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.900" end="01:13:52.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously? That&#39;s all. I had the fish</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.100" end="01:13:54.380" style="s2">head during the day, so it&#39;s your turn</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.420" end="01:13:56.740" style="s2">tonight. Make do with it. At least it&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.380" end="01:13:58.700" style="s2">take the edge off your hunger.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.740" end="01:14:00.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Linyo something else. He&#39;s always eating</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.700" end="01:14:03.180" style="s2">like a king, but all he gives us is one</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.781" end="01:14:04.781" style="s2">tiny fish. Not even enough for a bite.</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.180" end="01:14:06.180" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t care if all that fish goes</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.781" end="01:14:08.260" style="s2">bad and gets wasted.</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.180" end="01:14:11.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether it spoils or not is none of our</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.260" end="01:14:14.460" style="s2">business. It&#39;s not ours, so don&#39;t covet</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.220" end="01:14:14.460" style="s2">it. Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.620" end="01:14:20.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t Linyo say earlier that if we</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.500" end="01:14:21.940" style="s2">buttered him up, we&#39;d get more food?</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.100" end="01:14:23.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiangmei, are you going to sell</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.940" end="01:14:24.460" style="s2">yourself?</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.140" end="01:14:26.260" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t put it like that. It&#39;s just a</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.460" end="01:14:27.940" style="s2">mutually beneficial arrangement.</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.260" end="01:14:29.660" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiangmei, if that&#39;s what you want, I</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.940" end="01:14:31.180" style="s2">won&#39;t stop you. I just thought after</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.660" end="01:14:33.300" style="s2">seeing you fight Zhao Yu last night that</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.180" end="01:14:34.980" style="s2">you wouldn&#39;t let anyone else touch you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.300" end="01:14:37.060" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s different. What kind of man is</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.980" end="01:14:38.300" style="s2">Zhao Yu? The rescue team isn&#39;t coming.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.060" end="01:14:40.140" style="s2">Zhao Yu is just a useless waste of</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.300" end="01:14:43.700" style="s2">oxygen. Besides, Linyo&#39;s way better</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.140" end="01:14:43.700" style="s2">looking than that fat pig, Zhao Yu.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.300" end="01:14:54.180" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Yu,</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.620" end="01:14:56.060" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.180" end="01:14:59.060" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Yu, you came back for another</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.060" end="01:15:02.620" style="s2">beating. You never learn, do you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.060" end="01:15:05.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Zhao, how&#39;d you get caught?</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.620" end="01:15:06.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARE YOU TELLING ME WHAT TO DO?</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.100" end="01:15:07.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SO, what if you caught me?</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.781" end="01:15:11.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight,</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.980" end="01:15:15.340" style="s2">I&#39;ll make every one of you kneel.</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.100" end="01:15:15.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get them, all of you. Attack!</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.420" end="01:15:20.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Zhao, we don&#39;t know where those</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.420" end="01:15:22.620" style="s2">fruits came from. We really don&#39;t dare</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.500" end="01:15:24.500" style="s2">eat them.</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.620" end="01:15:26.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit the theatrics and get lost.</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.500" end="01:15:28.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Zhao.</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.100" end="01:15:28.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.032" end="01:15:31.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.060" end="01:15:34.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t eat it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.781" end="01:15:38.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll make you eat till you burst.</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.382" end="01:15:38.142" style="s2">Eat till you drop dead.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.622" end="01:15:47.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s Holly doing?</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.102" end="01:15:49.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows? They threatened to come after</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.942" end="01:15:52.222" style="s2">us, but now they&#39;re fighting among</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.502" end="01:15:54.102" style="s2">themselves. That&#39;s hilarious. Wait, look</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.222" end="01:15:54.942" style="s2">at those red berries. Don&#39;t they look</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.102" end="01:15:56.102" style="s2">familiar?</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.942" end="01:15:57.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe, something&#39;s wrong with those</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.102" end="01:15:58.422" style="s2">berries. Giving him so many could kill</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.942" end="01:16:01.022" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.422" end="01:16:02.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Screw you. You&#39;re all a bunch of gutless</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.022" end="01:16:05.062" style="s2">idiots. Get up.</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.982" end="01:16:08.182" style="s2">Quit playing dead in front of me, OR</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.062" end="01:16:08.182" style="s2">YOU&#39;LL REGRET IT.</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.302" end="01:16:19.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, LET GO.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.902" end="01:16:19.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t forget who did this to you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.812" end="01:16:23.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.122" end="01:16:23.142" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.182" end="01:16:32.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, DON&#39;T.</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.948" end="01:16:32.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.542" end="01:16:36.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TOLUENE IS DEAD.</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.662" end="01:16:38.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S OVER.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.862" end="01:16:40.822" style="s2">It&#39;s all over.</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.902" end="01:16:43.382" style="s2">I&#39;m going to Dawei Mountain National</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.822" end="01:16:45.358" style="s2">Forest Park. I&#39;m warning you, DON&#39;T DO</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.382" end="01:16:47.378" style="s2">ANYTHING STUPID.</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.358" end="01:16:47.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.462" end="01:17:08.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE REALLY DOES HAVE SUPERPOWERS.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.973" end="01:17:08.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.302" end="01:17:35.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LIN YUE,</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.342" end="01:17:38.903" style="s2">WHY DO THE FISH YOU catch always spit</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.503" end="01:17:38.903" style="s2">out all kinds of things.</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.183" end="01:17:45.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Funny you should ask. Shao Ning asked me</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.343" end="01:17:48.103" style="s2">the same thing before. And my answer was</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.703" end="01:17:50.983" style="s2">these fish are just greedy. What do you</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.103" end="01:17:50.983" style="s2">think, Anyue?</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.303" end="01:17:55.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s your secret. I won&#39;t pry.</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.903" end="01:18:01.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not bad, Anyue. You&#39;re smart.</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.183" end="01:18:04.743" style="s2">I like smart women.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.503" end="01:18:06.583" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hand smell like fish.</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.743" end="01:18:09.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s change the subject. Do you think</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.583" end="01:18:12.063" style="s2">this fish will spit something out?</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.023" end="01:18:13.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have food and water now. If possible,</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.063" end="01:18:14.703" style="s2">I hope it gives us something that could</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.463" end="01:18:18.703" style="s2">save our lives.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.703" end="01:18:18.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyue, are you making a wish?</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.103" end="01:18:33.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, I&#39;m warning you. You&#39;re carrying an</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.223" end="01:18:36.663" style="s2">illegal firearm, and you just killed</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.223" end="01:18:37.503" style="s2">someone. Not even God can save you now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.663" end="01:18:40.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so?</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.503" end="01:18:41.623" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the consequences are that serious,</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.023" end="01:18:44.943" style="s2">then it wouldn&#39;t be so bad if I killed</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.623" end="01:18:44.943" style="s2">one more, would it?</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.823" end="01:18:50.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, no. Lord Leo, I was wrong. I know I</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.783" end="01:18:52.303" style="s2">messed up. I shouldn&#39;t have run my</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.223" end="01:18:54.263" style="s2">mouth. I&#39;m an idiot. I SHOULD HAVE KNOWN</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.303" end="01:18:56.223" style="s2">BETTER. PLEASE, be the bigger man and</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.263" end="01:18:57.583" style="s2">let me off the hook. Just forget I was</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.223" end="01:18:58.983" style="s2">ever here.</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.583" end="01:19:00.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.983" end="01:19:02.663" style="s2">I was just messing with you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.663" end="01:19:05.623" style="s2">We&#39;re classmates, after all. Why would I</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.663" end="01:19:05.623" style="s2">do anything to you?</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.703" end="01:19:08.583" style="s2">You can go now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.943" end="01:19:18.183" style="s2">What are you waiting for?</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.303" end="01:19:18.183" style="s2">You can go, too.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.263" end="01:19:22.383" style="s2">Huo Tuo, I didn&#39;t think you had it in</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.103" end="01:19:23.543" style="s2">you. If you stay, aren&#39;t you afraid I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.383" end="01:19:25.823" style="s2">blow your head off?</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.543" end="01:19:27.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Navigate to Daping Times Square.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.823" end="01:19:29.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d be lying if I said I wasn&#39;t scared,</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.903" end="01:19:32.143" style="s2">but danger is everywhere on this island.</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.983" end="01:19:33.903" style="s2">I have no food and no water. Even if I</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.143" end="01:19:35.263" style="s2">get out of this alive, I&#39;ll just end up</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.903" end="01:19:37.063" style="s2">dead out here.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.263" end="01:19:38.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You see the bigger picture, unlike some</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.063" end="01:19:40.065" style="s2">idiots. They don&#39;t even know they&#39;re as</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.744" end="01:19:41.264" style="s2">good as dead.</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.065" end="01:19:43.465" style="s2">I won&#39;t [clears throat] be a freeloader.</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.264" end="01:19:45.425" style="s2">Let me work for you. What do you think?</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.465" end="01:19:46.585" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hutu was actually a good guy. He just</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.425" end="01:19:49.025" style="s2">doesn&#39;t think for himself.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.585" end="01:19:50.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree. He&#39;s a grown man, so why does</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.025" end="01:19:51.065" style="s2">he keep groveling to that fat pig, Zhou</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.624" end="01:19:53.264" style="s2">Yu?</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.065" end="01:19:54.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Besides, Hutu really helped us out at</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.264" end="01:19:55.264" style="s2">the beginning.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.025" end="01:19:57.104" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.264" end="01:19:59.824" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you a chance to make things</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.104" end="01:20:00.505" style="s2">right, but remember, you only get one</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.824" end="01:20:01.824" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.505" end="01:20:02.104" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll leave him in your hands from now</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.824" end="01:20:03.664" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.104" end="01:20:06.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Lin. We&#39;ll make sure he</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.664" end="01:20:06.465" style="s2">learns his place.</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.864" end="01:20:26.704" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO! PLEASE!</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.385" end="01:20:31.784" style="s2">OH, THIS ONE.</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.025" end="01:20:45.545" style="s2">SILA.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.144" end="01:20:48.545" style="s2">Get out!</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.545" end="01:20:48.545" style="s2">GET OUT OF HERE!</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.144" end="01:20:56.905" style="s2">DAMN LIN Yu</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.184" end="01:20:58.864" style="s2">and my Zhou Yu. Really going to spend my</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.905" end="01:21:01.985" style="s2">whole LIFE BENEATH THAT THIRD POOR</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.864" end="01:21:01.985" style="s2">LOSER, LIN YU?</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.505" end="01:21:06.664" style="s2">IF ONLY I COULD JOIN those cannibals.</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.905" end="01:21:11.704" style="s2">There we go.</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.385" end="01:21:24.945" style="s2">We&#39;re out here working. Why does</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.505" end="01:21:25.624" style="s2">EVERYONE LOOK MORE EXCITED THAN THE</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.945" end="01:21:27.425" style="s2">LAST?</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.624" end="01:21:29.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I DON&#39;T KNOW, BUT this is my first time</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.425" end="01:21:31.065" style="s2">on a raft like this. It&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.065" end="01:21:32.985" style="s2">pretty fun. We came out here to fish,</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.065" end="01:21:35.624" style="s2">but with you here, Lin Yu, it feels more</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.985" end="01:21:37.385" style="s2">like a day out. Lin Yu, are you tired?</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.624" end="01:21:39.224" style="s2">Want me to rub your shoulders?</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.385" end="01:21:42.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rub my shoulders? We&#39;ve only just</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.224" end="01:21:44.745" style="s2">started. I&#39;m not as weak as you think.</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.705" end="01:21:46.265" style="s2">And you, Sanyou, don&#39;t just sit there</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.745" end="01:21:47.946" style="s2">with your legs dangling in the water.</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.265" end="01:21:50.946" style="s2">Watch out, there could be sharks.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.946" end="01:21:53.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, sharks. Sharks.</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.946" end="01:21:54.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re close to shore. It&#39;s unlikely</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.026" end="01:21:56.825" style="s2">there are any sharks around. Wanyue is</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.986" end="01:21:57.546" style="s2">already gullible enough. Quit scaring</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.825" end="01:22:01.106" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.546" end="01:22:01.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just looking out for her safety.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.865" end="01:22:23.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Luo, Anyue, what were you two doing</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.305" end="01:22:26.305" style="s2">just now?</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.345" end="01:22:26.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; N- nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.265" end="01:22:50.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Glug. Glug.</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.546" end="01:22:56.426" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glug. Glug.</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.705" end="01:23:00.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glug. Glug.</p>
<p begin="01:22:59.367" end="01:23:02.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.506" end="01:23:04.186" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just passing by.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.546" end="01:23:09.225" style="s2">Just passing by.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.186" end="01:23:09.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uru. Uru. Gugu. Uru. Gugu.</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.506" end="01:23:22.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh, this is boring.</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.946" end="01:23:24.785" style="s2">I wish I could do something for Ling</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.506" end="01:23:27.066" style="s2">Luo.</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.785" end="01:23:29.426" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a fish. There are fish.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.066" end="01:23:32.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch it. It&#39;s a sea snake.</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.426" end="01:23:32.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; W- WATCH OUT.</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.705" end="01:23:38.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WANYUE, ARE YOU OKAY?</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.426" end="01:23:41.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOOK AT HER HAND.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.146" end="01:23:42.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Luo, my hand&#39;s numb and my chest</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.026" end="01:23:44.507" style="s2">feels so tight.</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.305" end="01:23:46.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I going to die out here?</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.507" end="01:23:47.387" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you&#39;ll be fine. It was just a snake</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.747" end="01:23:49.507" style="s2">bite.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.387" end="01:23:51.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not that simple. If I saw it right,</p>
<p begin="01:23:49.507" end="01:23:53.347" style="s2">that was a blue-gray sea snake. Its</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.307" end="01:23:55.387" style="s2">venom is so potent that even a king</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.347" end="01:23:57.187" style="s2">cobra&#39;s venom pales in comparison. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.387" end="01:23:58.307" style="s2">one of the most venomous sea snakes.</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.187" end="01:23:59.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then doesn&#39;t that mean</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.307" end="01:24:02.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t panic. The sea snake&#39;s venom is</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.867" end="01:24:04.147" style="s2">potent, but however, each spray contains</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.307" end="01:24:06.427" style="s2">very little venom, so it won&#39;t kill her</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.147" end="01:24:08.187" style="s2">right away. Still, things look grim.</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.427" end="01:24:10.107" style="s2">Without the proper antivenom, she has</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.187" end="01:24:11.547" style="s2">only a few hours. The venom will spread</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.107" end="01:24:12.147" style="s2">and eventually cause respiratory</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.547" end="01:24:14.587" style="s2">failure.</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.147" end="01:24:18.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we do?</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.587" end="01:24:20.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, why don&#39;t you let me try?</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.227" end="01:24:20.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.627" end="01:24:39.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. No. Where are we, man? I&#39;m one of</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.587" end="01:24:40.747" style="s2">you. I swear. Whatever your tribe needs,</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.227" end="01:24:43.747" style="s2">I CAN DO IT.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.747" end="01:24:43.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UNINTELLIGIBLE.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.307" end="01:24:50.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OH, screw it.</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.067" end="01:24:50.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aloha. Uluda.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.507" end="01:24:56.947" style="s2">Come in. Uluda.</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.827" end="01:24:58.787" style="s2">Uludagu.</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.947" end="01:25:00.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He seems to be asking me something. I</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.787" end="01:25:03.427" style="s2">have no idea what, but I better just say</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.707" end="01:25:03.427" style="s2">yes for now.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.627" end="01:25:09.067" style="s2">I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.667" end="01:25:10.507" style="s2">I actually pulled it off. Just you wait.</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.067" end="01:25:12.507" style="s2">Ling Yu, once I&#39;ve made a name for</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.507" end="01:25:15.467" style="s2">myself among these cannibals, YOU&#39;LL ALL</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.507" end="01:25:15.467" style="s2">PAY FOR THIS.</p>
<p begin="01:25:17.267" end="01:25:21.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YO, WEI WEI, THAT&#39;S IMPRESSIVE. You</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.387" end="01:25:21.947" style="s2">healed a venomous injury like that so</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.307" end="01:25:23.827" style="s2">easily.</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.947" end="01:25:25.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ling Yu, I wasn&#39;t trying to keep it from</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.827" end="01:25:27.947" style="s2">you. I only found out this morning.</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.867" end="01:25:29.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay. I&#39;m not blaming you. Xia Wei</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.947" end="01:25:31.307" style="s2">needs a life because of you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.507" end="01:25:32.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, Wei Wei, if you hadn&#39;t been there,</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.307" end="01:25:34.547" style="s2">I might have been a goner. And you think</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.747" end="01:25:35.987" style="s2">that&#39;s funny? Who told you to stick your</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.547" end="01:25:36.707" style="s2">hand in the water and grab whatever you</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.987" end="01:25:38.427" style="s2">found?</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.707" end="01:25:40.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just trying to catch another fish</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.427" end="01:25:42.267" style="s2">and take some of the load off Ling Yu.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.227" end="01:25:44.107" style="s2">Hey, do you think we all have</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.267" end="01:25:45.587" style="s2">superpowers now?</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.107" end="01:25:49.589" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to be Ling Yu.</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.587" end="01:25:51.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wei Wei&#39;s the healer, and I&#39;m the seer.</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.589" end="01:25:53.829" style="s2">Don&#39;t lump me in with you guys. I&#39;m just</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.789" end="01:25:56.269" style="s2">lucky, that&#39;s all. I don&#39;t have any</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.829" end="01:25:57.908" style="s2">superpowers. How can that be just luck?</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.269" end="01:26:00.069" style="s2">I and you were playing poker yesterday,</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.908" end="01:26:02.109" style="s2">and you won 27 hands in a row. We</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.069" end="01:26:04.549" style="s2">finally couldn&#39;t take it anymore, so we</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.109" end="01:26:06.509" style="s2">had to call it quits. It&#39;s survival of</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.549" end="01:26:08.908" style="s2">the fittest. Anyone who can survive on</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.509" end="01:26:11.948" style="s2">this deserted island may end up finding</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.908" end="01:26:13.749" style="s2">an unexpected opportunity.</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.948" end="01:26:16.029" style="s2">Are they all staring at me like I&#39;m some</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.749" end="01:26:19.749" style="s2">kind of spectacle? These primitive</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.029" end="01:26:22.269" style="s2">savages are so easy to fool.</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.749" end="01:26:26.549" style="s2">Hey you two, where are you taking me? I</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.269" end="01:26:26.549" style="s2">can walk, you know. I&#39;ve got legs.</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.789" end="01:26:56.709" style="s2">I&#39;m supposed to fight this monster?</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.469" end="01:26:56.709" style="s2">Are you kidding me?</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.100" end="01:27:01.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.340" end="01:27:05.029" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.995" end="01:27:08.589" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.029" end="01:27:10.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ha, I can&#39;t run. If I try to escape now,</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.589" end="01:27:12.229" style="s2">those damn cannibals will chop me up and</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.549" end="01:27:14.428" style="s2">throw me in the pot.</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.229" end="01:27:16.469" style="s2">Calm down. Fighting isn&#39;t just about</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.428" end="01:27:20.149" style="s2">brute force. I just need to watch the</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.469" end="01:27:20.149" style="s2">savage&#39;s moves closely.</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.990" end="01:27:26.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.430" end="01:28:11.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin You. Looks like another downpour is</p>
<p begin="01:28:10.830" end="01:28:13.670" style="s2">coming.</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.710" end="01:28:15.190" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s definitely going to rain. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.670" end="01:28:16.510" style="s2">worried something else might come out in</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.190" end="01:28:19.430" style="s2">the chaos.</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.510" end="01:28:19.430" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something else?</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.190" end="01:28:24.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin, there&#39;s a huge snake down the</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.990" end="01:28:24.510" style="s2">mountain.</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.146" end="01:28:32.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.590" end="01:28:40.830" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a breath and tell me exactly what</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.350" end="01:28:42.350" style="s2">happened.</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.830" end="01:28:43.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, Lin, we went down to gather</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.350" end="01:28:45.950" style="s2">firewood like you told us, but we barely</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.910" end="01:28:46.630" style="s2">started when we saw a huge snake lying</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.950" end="01:28:48.110" style="s2">in THE WOODS.</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.630" end="01:28:48.630" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S RIGHT, BROTHER LIN. IT WAS THIS</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.110" end="01:28:49.830" style="s2">BIG.</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.630" end="01:28:50.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never seen a snake that big.</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.830" end="01:28:51.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.470" end="01:28:53.750" style="s2">it has to be the Titan Python. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.950" end="01:28:54.430" style="s2">here. Let&#39;s stay up here and not go back</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.750" end="01:28:56.590" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.430" end="01:28:57.830" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, this storm could last for days. If</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.590" end="01:28:59.150" style="s2">we don&#39;t stock up on enough firewood,</p>
<p begin="01:28:57.830" end="01:29:00.750" style="s2">the temperature could drop at night and</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.150" end="01:29:02.470" style="s2">we&#39;ll freeze to death. So, we have to</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.750" end="01:29:04.830" style="s2">go. Don&#39;t worry, we can change what</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.470" end="01:29:06.150" style="s2">happens. Besides, that snake is a real</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.830" end="01:29:07.990" style="s2">threat. We&#39;ll have to deal with it</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.150" end="01:29:10.870" style="s2">sooner or later. Let&#39;s go. Let&#39;s go see</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.990" end="01:29:10.870" style="s2">what we&#39;re dealing with.</p>
<p begin="01:29:15.430" end="01:29:20.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is, brother Lin. The snake is</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.430" end="01:29:20.110" style="s2">still there.</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.430" end="01:29:29.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t [snorts] panic. This is just a</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.710" end="01:29:31.270" style="s2">giant snake&#39;s shed skin.</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.350" end="01:29:32.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of monster is this? It must be</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.270" end="01:29:34.030" style="s2">at least 20 m long.</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.710" end="01:29:35.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin, can the three of us really take it</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.030" end="01:29:35.910" style="s2">on? We can&#39;t beat it with brute force</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.390" end="01:29:37.230" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.910" end="01:29:38.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But we&#39;re human. Our intelligence is</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.230" end="01:29:39.870" style="s2">beyond that of any other creature.</p>
<p begin="01:29:38.510" end="01:29:40.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Panda Pan Er, stick to the plan I told</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.870" end="01:29:41.310" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.390" end="01:29:42.990" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Lin.</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.310" end="01:29:44.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, on the other hand, have a different</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.990" end="01:29:45.630" style="s2">job. Lin, do you still remember where</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.550" end="01:29:46.910" style="s2">the cannibal tribe is?</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.630" end="01:29:47.430" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, it&#39;s in the direction you went</p>
<p begin="01:29:46.910" end="01:29:49.550" style="s2">before, Lin.</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.430" end="01:29:53.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Head up the mountain now and bring</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.550" end="01:29:53.592" style="s2">down all the fish I&#39;ve caught. Then</p>
<p begin="01:29:55.952" end="01:29:57.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.231" end="01:30:09.111" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gollum.</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.391" end="01:30:09.111" style="s2">Aruka.</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.362" end="01:30:12.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.791" end="01:30:19.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.751" end="01:30:19.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, oh, Gollum, Gollum.</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.111" end="01:30:24.271" style="s2">&gt;&gt; According to paleontological research,</p>
<p begin="01:30:22.151" end="01:30:26.871" style="s2">Titanoboa thrived in hot, humid</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.271" end="01:30:28.431" style="s2">conditions, mainly in swamps and lakes.</p>
<p begin="01:30:26.871" end="01:30:30.311" style="s2">If the air hadn&#39;t grown more humid</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.431" end="01:30:32.151" style="s2">before the storm, it wouldn&#39;t have left</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.311" end="01:30:33.671" style="s2">its territory. The vegetation here has</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.151" end="01:30:35.951" style="s2">shifted entirely to moisture-loving</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.671" end="01:30:38.031" style="s2">plants. If I&#39;m right, the land ahead is</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.951" end="01:30:41.151" style="s2">low and waterlogged. It must be the</p>
<p begin="01:30:38.031" end="01:30:41.151" style="s2">island&#39;s natural swamp.</p>
<p begin="01:31:23.831" end="01:31:28.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You idiots. I joined the cannibal tribe</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.431" end="01:31:31.511" style="s2">to use them to kill someone, not to</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.631" end="01:31:34.111" style="s2">stand guard for you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:31.511" end="01:31:36.431" style="s2">Come to think of it, it&#39;s been ages, and</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.111" end="01:31:37.511" style="s2">I&#39;m not hungry at all. Plus, nothing can</p>
<p begin="01:31:36.431" end="01:31:41.151" style="s2">kill me.</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.511" end="01:31:43.191" style="s2">Could I have mutated or something?</p>
<p begin="01:31:41.151" end="01:31:47.031" style="s2">With strength like this, why would I</p>
<p begin="01:31:43.191" end="01:31:47.031" style="s2">waste my time guarding the gate?</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.751" end="01:31:54.072" style="s2">I&#39;ve got an idea.</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.352" end="01:32:22.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.792" end="01:32:31.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gurgle. Gurgle.</p>
<p begin="01:32:27.193" end="01:32:36.272" style="s2">Enjoy your last moments while you can.</p>
<p begin="01:32:31.352" end="01:32:36.272" style="s2">Your time is up. It&#39;s coming soon.</p>
<p begin="01:32:56.073" end="01:32:59.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you waiting for?</p>
<p begin="01:32:57.153" end="01:32:59.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run.</p>
<p begin="01:33:13.764" end="01:33:15.784" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:33:20.272" end="01:33:24.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough fish to feed us for 2</p>
<p begin="01:33:22.113" end="01:33:28.032" style="s2">months on this island. Who knows what</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.432" end="01:33:28.032" style="s2">Lin Yao plans to do with them.</p>
<p begin="01:33:33.992" end="01:33:38.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lin, it looks like it&#39;s getting closer.</p>
<p begin="01:33:36.272" end="01:33:39.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. One adult came and won&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="01:33:38.113" end="01:33:41.352" style="s2">enough to fill that thing&#39;s belly. What</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.792" end="01:33:44.073" style="s2">I asked you to prepare will come in</p>
<p begin="01:33:41.352" end="01:33:44.073" style="s2">handy soon.</p>
<p begin="01:33:58.304" end="01:34:00.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.394" end="01:34:20.634" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karuda.</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.634" end="01:34:20.634" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karuda. Karuda.</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.994" end="01:34:24.634" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gulumon. Karu Gumon.</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.314" end="01:34:30.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kasa Karuda. Gulumusa.</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.674" end="01:34:31.274" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got a problem? Then get lost.</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.314" end="01:34:32.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ka.</p>
<p begin="01:34:31.274" end="01:34:33.914" style="s2">Kulu.</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.314" end="01:34:36.434" style="s2">Akasa Ulu.</p>
<p begin="01:34:33.914" end="01:34:36.434" style="s2">Aha.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
